<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">YOHANE NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANE</para>
  <para style="mt4">NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="ip">Sebedeo awa Yohane yeɛ ɔhworɔle sɔ nzɛmba he ɔ, né oliema yeɛ ole Yakobo. Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu frɛle bɛ kyɛ bɛɛyɛ ye asuafoɛ ne, né bɛne bɛ baba Sebedeo te ɛlɛen nu bɛpomba bɛ nɛt. Ná afoɛ 31 Pɛnu afahyɛ ne si ne, Yesu yele Yohane ne oliema Yakobo bokale asuafoɛ 12 naso. Né Yohane boka Yesu nnamvo bɔ ɔne bɛ bɔ paa naso. Ná mmerɛ bɔ ne Yesu sinze asɛnnua naso ne, ye ala yeɛ ɔfale ye maame Mary wurale ye sa ɔ. Ye yeɛ ne bɛtaa bɛka ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ “suaniɛ bɔ Yesu kuro ye dwirɛ” anaa “suaniɛ bɔ Yesu dɔ ye” ne. — <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:23">Yoh 13:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:2">20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:7">21:7</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛ ɛnea nzɛmba nna ne a, Yohane nzɛmba ne yeɛ ɔpɛ yebo ɔ. Ɔhworɔle ye nzɛmba ne kɔyɛ afoɛ 98 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> sɔ mmerɛ ne, né basɛkye Yerusalem kuro ne dada. Ye dwirɛ nanu pee wɔ berɛ a, ɛngonwu ye wɔ nzɛmba nza bɔ waha nanu, ofikyɛ ɔfale ye adwene siele ngɔmmɔ bɔ Yesu ne mmenia bɔle naso paa. Ye nzɛmba ne ka edwirɛ bɔ osisile wɔ Yesu asetena nu wɔ afoɛ 29 kosi afoɛ 33 Y.A. Sɛ ɛnea mmerɛ bɔ Yohane hworɔle ye nzɛmba ne a, sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔwɔ Efeso. Na bɛ bɔ ɔhworɔle ye dwirɛ ne mane bɛ paa yeɛ ole Yudafoɛ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ ne bɛwɔ Efeso ne ye si dɔ ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane nzɛmba ne maa yɛnwu kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ole Mezaya ne, ná ye yeɛ ole Nyameɛ Awa ne. Sɛ mmenia nya gyidie wɔ Yesu nu a, bekonya daa ngoa. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:30-31">Yoh 20:30-31</ref></char>) Nningyein pee yeɛ Yohane hworɔle bɔ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ Yesu yeɛ ole Mezaya ne, ebie yeɛ ole nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ Yesu yɛle, adanzeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Hebri Tworɔnzɛm nanu, edwirɛ bɔ Yohane Suboniɛ hane, edwirɛ bɔ Yesu bɔbɔ hane, edwirɛ bɔ Nyameɛ hane, ɔne bɔ Yohane bɔbɔ nwuni ye ne.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ ne yɛle anwoɔnaen, na ɔɔtenane yɛ nu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adanzeɛ bɔ Yohane Suboniɛ li fale Yesu nwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-34">1:19-34</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asuafoɛ bɔ oli moa nyane bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">1:35-51</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ oli moa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">2:1-11</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ afoɛ 30 Y.A. Pɛnu nabo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:12-25">2:12-25</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu fale Samaria mmerɛ bɔ ɔkɔ Galilea ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4:1-54">4:1-54</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Asɛnka bɔ Yesu yɛle wɔ afoɛ 31 Y.A ne ye si (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5:1-47">5:1-47</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pɛnu afahyɛ bɔ ɔhɔle so afoɛ 32 Y.A ne bɔ osili wɔ ye si (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:1-7:1">6:1–7:1</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ofi mmerɛ bɔ bɛlili Apata Afahyɛ ne bɔ ɔkɔ ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:2-9:41">7:2–9:41</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ofi afoɛ 32 Y.A ɔkwaadwu Nizan 10, afoɛ 33 Y.A. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 10:1-12:50">10:1–12:50</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pɛnu afahyɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo bɔ Yesu lili, ɔne afutuo bɔ ɔfa mane asuafoɛ nemɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-17:26">13:1–17:26</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛyele Yesu bɛmane, bɛhyele ye, na bɛhuni ye (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 18:1-19:42">18:1–19:42</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu yele ye nwo ali mmerɛ bɔ otingyele ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-21:25">20:1–21:25</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ahyɛaseɛ ne, né Edwirɛ ne wɔ berɛ, né Edwirɛ ne né Nyameɛ yeɛ bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ, na né Edwirɛ ne te nyameɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ahyɛaseɛ ne, ye yeɛ né ɔne Nyameɛ wɔ berɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Nningyein mukoraati nate ye so yeɛ ɔwale ɔ, na bammɔ nikye fee bɔ né ɔbokka so ɔ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Na bangwati ye bannyɛ nikye fee.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Nikye bɔ ɔnate ye so wale yeɛ ole ngoa, na ngoa ne yeɛ ole mmenia kanea. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Kanea ne ta awosii nu, na awosii ne angora angata kanea naso.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nyameɛ somane biaa bie, né ye dumaa li Yohane. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Sɔ biaa he wale kyɛ ɔbaali adanzeɛ. Né ɔbaali kanea nanwo adanzeɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala nate ye so kole koli. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Nná ye yeɛ ne ɔte kanea ne, mmom ne ɔbaali kanea nanwo adanzeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Nahorɛ kanea bɔ ɔta ma mmenia mukoraati ne, né ɔba wiase. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Né ɔwɔ wiase, na bɛnate ye so yeɛ bɛyɛle wiase ne ɔ, nakoso wiase ne nze ye. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ɔwale ye bɔbɔ ye awuro, nakoso ye mmenia anne ye. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛlɛle ye, na benyane gyidie wɔ ye dumaa nanu ne, ɔmaa bɛyɛle Nyameɛ mmaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Nna mogya, anwoɔnaen, anaa brienzua so yeɛ bɛnate bɛwole bɛ ɔ, mmom Nyameɛ bɔbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Na edwirɛ ne yɛle anwoɔnaen ɔɔtenane yɛ nu, na yɛnwuni ye anuonyam, anuonyam bɔ baba fa ma ɔwa bɔ owole ye komapɛ ne, bɔ adom ne nahorɛ ayi ye tɛkyɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohane lili ye nwo adanzeɛ, na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ ngane ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ, ‘Bɔ oli me si ɔba ne, wali me nyunu dada, ofikyɛ né ɔwɔ berɛ kora yeɛ meba ɔ.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Adom bɔ wayi ye tɛkyɛ nati, yɛ mukoraati yanya adom pee yafi ye berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mmeraa ne de, bɛnate Mose so yeɛ bɛfa bɛmane ɔ; na adom ne nahorɛ ne de, ɔnate Yesu Kristo so yeɛ ɔwale ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ wanwu Nyameɛ le; Baa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “nyameɛ.”</char></note> komapɛ twen bɔ ɔwɔ Baba ne nwo berɛ ne, ye yeɛ wamaa yanwu kyɛbɔ ɔte ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Yudafoɛ ne somane asɔfo ne Lewifoɛ fili Yerusalem hɔle Yohane berɛ kyɛ bɛɛbisa ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa?” Na adanzeɛ he yeɛ ɔfa mane ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Wannza, mmom ɔhane ye pefee kyɛ: “Nná me yeɛ nne Kristo ne.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzaade, ɛte nwa? Elia?” Ɔyele ye noa kyɛ: “Nnde Elia.” “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle diifoɛ ne?” Ɔhane kyɛ: “Daabi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Ye de, wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa? Ka kyire yɛ, ná wamaa yanya edwirɛ bie yaha yahyire bɛ bɔ bɛsomane yɛ ne. Nzu yeɛ ɛka fa wɔ nwo ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Me yeɛ nne konviɛ bɔ ɔteanu wɔ ɛserɛ so dɔ kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Ɛmɔ tengyɛ Awurade atee,’ kyɛbɔ diifoɛ Isaiah hane ne.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Bɛ bɔ bɛsomane bɛ ne, né bɛboka Farisifoɛ naso. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Yeti besa bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Sɛ nná wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne, Elia, anaa diifoɛ ne a, ye de nzuati yeɛ ɛbɔ asu ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohane ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me de, nzue yeɛ mefa mebɔ asu ɔ. Na ebie gyi ɛmɔ afia bɔ ɛmɔnze ye. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ye yeɛ oli me si ɔba ne, na ye mmaboa nyamaa po, menvata kyɛ mesangye.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ɛhe hɔle so wɔ Betania, Yordan nzue ne si dɔ, nekaa bɔ né Yohane bɔ asu ne.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Kyẽa bɔ oli berɛ ne, Yohane nwuni Yesu kyɛ ɔba ye berɛ, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea Nyameɛ Boan Ba bɔ ɔye wiase bɔne fi berɛ ne! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ɛhe yeɛ ngane ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ: ‘Bɔ oli me si ɔba ne, wali me nyunu dada, ofikyɛ né ɔwɔ berɛ kora yeɛ meba’ ne. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Me po, né menze ye, nakoso mmale kyɛ mebaafa nzue mebɔ asu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔmaa Israel konwu ye ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohane koso lili adanzeɛ kyɛ: “Nwuni kyɛ honhom ne fi anwuro ɔba te kyɛ abubure, na oogyinane ye so. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Ɔwɔ nu né menze ye, nakoso bɔ ɔsomane me kyɛ mma mmɔ asu wɔ nzue nu ne ha hyirele me kyɛ: ‘Sona bɔ ekonwu kyɛ honhom ne fi anwuro waagyina ye so ne, ye yeɛ ɔfa honhom krongron bɔ asu ne.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Mafa me nye manwu ye, na medi ye nwo adanzeɛ mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛhe yeɛ ole Nyameɛ Awa ne.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Aleɛ hene bieku ne, né Yohane ne ye asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ gyi berɛ, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />na mmerɛ bɔ onwuni kyɛ Yesu nate berɛ ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea, Nyameɛ Boan Ba ne ɛhe!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Asuafoɛ nyɔ ne tele bɔ ɔhane ne, na bɛɛlili Yesu si. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu kakyile ye nwo, na onwuni kyɛ beli ye si, yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔpena nzu?” Bɛha bɛ hyire ye kyɛ: “Rabi (yebo kyire Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ), nisua yeɛ ɛte ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔbra, na ɛmɔ konwu ye.” Yeti bɛne ye hɔle, na bɛnwuni nekaa bɔ ɔte ɔ, na sɔ kyẽa ne, bɛne ye tenane berɛ; né wabɔ kɔyɛ nnɔsoa 4:00.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">4:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nná.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Mmenia nyɔ bɔ bɛtele Yohane dwirɛ ne, ná bɛɛlili Yesu si ne, kõ yeɛ ole Simon Petro aliema Andrea. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Bɔ oli moa yɛle yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔɔpenane oliema Simon, yeɛ ɔha hyire ye kyɛ: “Yanwu Mezaya ne” (bɔ yebo kyire “Kristo” ne), <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />na ɔfale ye hɔle Yesu berɛ. Yesu nwuni ye ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle Yohane awa Simon; bɛkɔfrɛ wɔ ‘Kefa’” (yebo kyire “Petro”).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Aleɛ hene ne, né Yesu pena kyɛ ɔkɔ Galilea. Na mmerɛ bɔ onwuni Filipo ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baali me si.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Né Filipo fi Betsaida, ɛberɛ ala yeɛ Andrea ne Petro fi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo nwuni Natanael, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bɔ Mose hworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ Mmeraa nanu, na adiifoɛ nemɔ hworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ ne, yanwu ye. Yosef awa Yesu bɔ ofi Nazerɛt ne.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanael ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛnea a, nikye pa bie kɔhora kofi Nazerɛt kɔwa?” Filipo ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baanea.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu nwuni kyɛ Natanael ba ye nwo berɛ ne, ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea, Israelniɛ paa bɔ nnaka-naka nne ye nu ɛhe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanael bisale ye kyɛ: “Ɔyɛle sɛɛ yeɛ ɛnwuni me ɔ?” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nwuni wɔ wɔ borɔdoma bakaa nabo dɔ, kora yeɛ Filipo baafrɛ wɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanael hane kyɛ: “Rabi, wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ awa ne, wɔ yeɛ ɛte Israelfoɛ hene ne.” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Nga ngyirele wɔ kyɛ, nwuni wɔ wɔ borɔdoma bakaa nabo dɔ nati yeɛ alɛ́ ali ne? Ekonwu nningyein bɔ ɔte mbiri tra sɔa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ anwuro abukye, na Nyameɛ abɔfo nemɔ di ahuru-saen wɔ Sona Awa naso.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ye ɛlɛsa so ne, né bɛyɛ ayeforɔ bie wɔ Kana bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne, na ne Yesu maame wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Na bɛfrɛle Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ maa bɛwale bie. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Bɛ nzãa ne yiele, yeti Yesu maame ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bɛ nzãa ne ayie oo.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Maame, ɛhe de, ɔfa mene wɔ nwo sɛ? Me mmerɛ nya sonne.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Na ye maame ha hyirele asomvoɛ ne kyɛ: “Bɔ ɔkaha kohyire ɛmɔ biala ne, ɛmɔyɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Kyɛbɔ Yudafoɛ ahoteɛ nwo mmeraa te ne, né bua mbiri-mbiri nzia bɔ bafa nyɔboɛ bayɛ gyigyi berɛ, na ne kõ biala kora fa nzue bua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛhe te bua mmaa-mmaa bɔ enu biala kora fa nzue lita 22 anaa anwa galɔn kõ.</char></note> nyɔ anaa nza. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔsa nzue bɛgua bua nemɔ nu ma oyi.” Yeti, bɛsale nzue bɛguale bua nemɔ nu maa oyili dɛm. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Afei ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔsa bie bɛɛma bɔ ɔnea ayeforɔ naso ne.” Yeti bɛsa bɛhɔle. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Na mmerɛ bɔ sona bɔ ɔnea ayeforɔ naso ne fale nzue bɔ wakakyi nzãa ne hane ye noa ne, né ɔnze nekaa bɔ ofi ɔ, (nakoso asomvoɛ bɔ bɛsale nzue ne de, né bɛse), yeɛ ɔfrɛle brienzua bɔ ogya ne hɔle ahameɛ, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ebiala di moa fa nzãa pa ne ba, na sɛ mmenia ne bo yie a, né wafa bɔ ɔttemaye ne wawa. Na wɔ de, afa nzãa pa ne asie tonn maa waadwu bekye.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ɛhe yeɛ ole nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ Yesu limoa yɛle, na ɔyɛle ye wɔ Kana bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne, na ɔlale ye anuonyam ali. Na asuafoɛ nemɔ nyane gyidie wɔ ye nu.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ɛhe si ne, ɔne ye maame, oliema nemɔ ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ hɔle Kapernaum, nakoso bandena berɛ bangyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Né Yudafoɛ Pɛnu né apingye, na Yesu hɔle Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Na ɔhɔle asɔre awuro berɛ ne, onwuni bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne nandwie, mmoan, ne mmubure, afei onwuni bɛ bɔ bɛsesã sikaa koso wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yeti ɔfale nyamaa yɛle kain, na ɔfoale bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne mmoan ne nandwie ne fili asɔre awuro berɛ, na bɛ bɔ bɛsesã sikaa ne, ohwiele bɛ sikaa nemɔ guale, na ɔhane bɛ tɛbulu nemɔ guale ase. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne mmubure ne kyɛ: “Ɛmɔfa ɛhemɔ bɛfi wa bɛhɔ! Na ɛmɔyakyi dwaa bɔ ɛmɔdi ye wɔ me Baba awuro wa ne!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kayele kyɛ, bahworɔ kyɛ: “Wɔ awuro nanwo dɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmɔdemmɔ.”</char></note> kɔyɛ kyɛ see bɔ ɔsɔ wɔ me nu ne.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ bisale ye kyɛ, “Nzɛngyerɛneɛ beni yeɛ ɛkɔyɛ kɔfa kohyire kyɛ ele ye nwo atee kyɛ ɛyɛ ɛhe ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu ha hyire bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔdwiri asɔre awuro ne bɛgua, na ngɔfa ɛlɛsa ngɔma so ngosie berɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Asɔre awuro bɔ bɛfale afoɛ 46 bɛsili ne, ɛfa ɛlɛsa ma so sie berɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Nakoso ye de, mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane asɔre awuro ne, ye nipadua nanwo dwirɛ yeɛ ne ɔka ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Otingye fili ewue nu ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kayele kyɛ ne ɔtaa ka sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɛhe maa bɛlɛle tworɔnzɛm ne né edwirɛ bɔ Yesu hane ne bɛlili.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Pɛnu afahyɛ nabo wɔ Yerusalem ne, nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ mmeni pee nwuni kyɛ ɔyɛ nati, benyane gyidie wɔ ye dumaa nanu. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Nakoso Yesu de wamva ye nwo wando bɛ so, ofikyɛ né ɔse bɛ mukoraati; <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />na né onhia kyɛ ebiala di sona nwo adanzeɛ kyire ye, ofikyɛ ɔse bɔ ɔwɔ ebiala ahone nu ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Né Farisiniɛ bie wɔ berɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Nikodemo, na né ɔte Yudafoɛ mbanyi nanu kõ. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Sɔ biaa he wale Yesu berɛ kɔngɔen, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Rabi, yɛse kyɛ ɛte kyerɛkyerɛniɛ bɔ efi Nyameɛ berɛ, ofikyɛ ebiala ngɔhora ngɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ɛyɛ ne, sana Nyameɛ boka ye so.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Na Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire wɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ banwo ebie foforɛ a, ɔngɔhora ngonwu Nyameɛ Ahennie ne.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo koso bisale ye kyɛ: “Panyi-banyi de, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né bahora bawo ye bieku? Aso ɔkɔhora kɔhɔ ye maame kunu maa ɔkɔwo ye bieku?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu koso yele ye noa kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire wɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ ebie kɔhora kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nu a, sana bɛfa nzue ne honhom bɛwo ye. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Bɔ bawo ye anwoɔnaen nu ne te anwoɔnaen, na bɔ bawo ye honhom nu ne te honhom. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nnɛmaa ɔyɛ wɔ nwanwa kyɛ, nga ngyirele wɔ kyɛ, ‘Odikyɛ bɛwo ɛmɔ bieku.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mvrama bɔ kɔ nekaa bɔ okuro ɔ; ɛte ye nga; nakoso ɛnze nekaa bɔ ofi, anaa nekaa bɔ ɔkɔ ɔ. Sɔ ala yeɛ ebie bɔ bafa honhom bawo ye ne te ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Na Nikodemo bisale ye kyɛ: “Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ɛhemɔ ahora ayɛ yé?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nnaa ɛte kyerɛkyerɛniɛ wɔ Israel, yeɛ ɛnze ɛhemɔ ne? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire wɔ ole kyɛ: Bɔ yɛse yeɛ yɛka ɔ, na bɔ yanwu ye yeɛ yɛdi ye nwo adanzeɛ ɔ; nakoso ɛmɔnne y'adanzeɛ ne benni. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Sɛ maha aseɛ so dwirɛ mahyire ɛmɔ, ná ɛmɔ anne banni a, ye de sɛ meka anwuro dwirɛ mekyire ɛmɔ a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Afei koso, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ wafo wahɔ anwuro ɔ, sana Sona Awa ne bɔ ofili anwuro wale ne ngome. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Na kyɛbɔ Mose mane ɛwoo naso wɔ ɛserɛ naso ne, sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ bɛma Sona Awa naso ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala bɔ okole ye koli ne konya daa ngoa.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />“Na Nyameɛ dɔ wiase paa, yeti ɔfale Ɔwa komapɛ bɔ owole ye ne mane, ná ebiala bɔ okonya gyidie wɔ ye nu ne, ɔngɔsɛkye,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔngɔ mini.”</char></note> mmom okonya daa ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Na Nyameɛ anzoma Ɔwa ne amma wiase kyɛ, oobu wiase atɛn, mmom ɔkɔfa ye so kole wiase. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ ye di ne, bɛngobu ye atɛn, nakoso ebiala bɔ onne ye nni ne, babu ye atɛn dada, ofikyɛ wannya gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ Awa komapɛ ne dumaa nu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Na bɔ yeti yeɛ bɛbu atɛn ne yeɛ ole kyɛ: Kanea awa wiase, nakoso mmenia kuro awosii ne tra kanea ne, ofikyɛ bɛ nneyɛɛ te bɔne. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Ná ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Akyiwadeɛ.”</char></note> ne, okyi kanea ne, na ɔmma kanea nanu, ná ye nneyɛɛ nwo anna berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ nikye pa ne ba kanea nanu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔla ali pefee kyɛ ɔyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ɛhe si ne, Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ ne hɔle Yudea nnamue nemɔ nu, ɔne bɛ tenane berɛ kaa, na ɔbɔle mmenia asu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Na Yohane koso, né ɔbɔ asu wɔ Ainon bɔ opingye Salim ne, ofikyɛ né nzue pee wɔ berɛ; na mmeni pee wale ye berɛ maa ɔbɔle bɛ asu. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, ne benya bɛhyelle Yohane bɛtolle prizin.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Na Yohane asuafoɛ nemɔ ne Yudaniɛ bie suli aporowaa twann bie, né ɔfa ahoteɛ nwo. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Yeti bɛwale Yohane berɛ bɛɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Rabi, biaa bɔ ne ɛne ye wɔ Yordan nzue ne si dɔ, bɔ ɛlili ye nwo adanzeɛ ne, nea, ye koso ɔbɔ asu, na ebiala kɔ ye berɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohane ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie kɔhora konya nikye bie a, sana bafa bafi anwuro bama ye. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔdi me adanzeɛ kyɛ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Nná me yeɛ nne Kristo ne, mmom basoma me kyɛ nni ye nyunu moa.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Bɔ ayeforɔ ne wɔ ye berɛ ne, ye yeɛ ole biaa bɔ ogya ne. Na brienzua bɔ ogya ne damvo ne de, sɛ ogyi berɛ, na ɔte bɔ ogya ne konvi a, ye nye gye paa. Yeti, m'anigye ali mu. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ye de, odikyɛ onya mmeni pee, na me de, odikyɛ me so te.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Bɔ ofi anwuro ne de, ɔtra ebiala. Na bɔ ofi aseɛ so ne fi aseɛ so, na ɔka aseɛ he aso dwirɛ. Na bɔ ofi anwuro ne, ɔtra ebiala. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Bɔ wanwu ye, na wate ne, ɛhene yeɛ odi ye nwo adanzeɛ ɔ, nakoso, ebiala nne ye adanzeɛ ne ndonu. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ́ ye adanzeɛ ne to nu ne, wasi ye pi<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Wafa nikye watimu so kyɛ.”</char></note> kyɛ, Nyameɛ te ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Na bɔ Nyameɛ asoma ye ne, ɔka Nyameɛ dwirɛ, ofikyɛ sɛ́ Nyameɛ fa ye honhom ne ma a, onzusu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyameɛ fa ye honhom ne ma maa ɔbo so.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Baba ne dɔ Baa ne, na wafa nikye biala wawura ye sa. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ́ Baa ne di ne, ole daa ngoa; na bɔ ondie Baa ne, ɔngonwu ngoa, na Nyameɛ afɛ ye so yaa paa.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Afei Yesu nwuni kyɛ Farisifoɛ nemɔ ate kyɛ wanya asuafoɛ pee, ná ɔbɔ mmeni pee asu tra Yohane ne, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(ɔwɔ nu, Yesu bɔbɔ ammɔ asu, mmom ye asuafoɛ nemɔ yeɛ ne bɛbɔ asu ne), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />ofili Yudea hɔle Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Nakoso né odikyɛ ɔfa Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Yeti, oodwuli Samaria kuro bie so; bɛfrɛ ɛberɛ Sikar, opingye aseɛ bɔ Yakob fa mane ɔwa Yosef ne. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ ne Yakob abura ne wɔ ɔ. Né akwanduo ne amaa Yesu afɛ, yeti ɔtenane abura nanwo berɛ. Né wabɔ kɔyɛ eyia 12:00.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">12:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Maame bie fi Samaria wale berɛ kyɛ ɔbaasa nzue. Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ma me nzue ne bie ma nno.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Né ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ahɔ kuro nu bɛkwaatɔ aleɛ.) <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Yeti Samarianiɛ braa ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ wɔ bɔ ɛte Yudaniɛ ne, ɛsrɛ me Samarianiɛ brasua berɛ nzue ne?” (Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Samariafoɛ ne Yudafoɛ ngã.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu koso mane ye mmuayɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛse akyɛdeɛ bɔ Nyameɛ fa ma mbaen, ɔne sona-horɛ bɔ ɔka kyire wɔ kyɛ, ‘Ma me nzue ne bie ma nno’ ne a, ahaa asrɛ ye maa wama wɔ ngoa nzue ne bie.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Maame ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, ɛlle nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛsa nzue po, na abura ne koso, enu wale paa. Ye de nisua yeɛ enyane sɔ ngoa nzue ne ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Yɛ nana Yakob bɔ otuli abura he mane yɛ, na ɔne ye mmaa ne ye nyɛmmoa none bie ne, ɛte piri tra ye anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔno abura he anu nzue ne, nzuhɔen kosa kohu ye. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Nakoso bɔ ɔkɔno nzue bɔ mefa mema ne de, nzuhɔen nngohu ye le. Na nzue bɔ ngɔfa ngɔma ye ne, ɔkɔyɛ nzue ti wɔ ye nu bɔ opu kɔ daa ngoa nu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Maame ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, ye de ma me sɔ nzue ne bie, ná nzuhɔen angu me maa daa mamma wa kyɛ mebaasa nzue.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kɔfrɛ ɛhu, na ɛne ye bra.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Maame ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nngya bia.” Yesu hane kyɛ: “Aha nahorɛ, ɔte amba, ‘Eggya bia.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ofikyɛ agya mmrienzua nnu, na bɔ ɛne ye te berɛ kesaalae ne po, nná ɛhu ɔ. Yeti bɔ aha ne te nahorɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Maame ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, mekora menwu kyɛ ɛte diifoɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Né yɛ nana mɔ sõ Nyameɛ wɔ bokaa he aso, nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnwa Yerusalem yeɛ ɔte nekaa bɔ odikyɛ ebiala basõ Nyameɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Maame, dɛ́ me di, mmerɛ bie ba, bɔ nná bokaa he aso anaa Yerusalem yeɛ ɛmɔkɔsõ Baba ne ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Bɔ ɛmɔsõ ye ne, ɛmɔnze ye; na yɛ de, yɛse bɔ yɛsõ ye ne, ofikyɛ Yudafoɛ yeɛ Nyameɛ nate bɛ so kole ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Nakoso mmerɛ bie ba, na wadwu, kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛsõ Nyameɛ nahorɛ nu ne kɔsõ Baba ne wɔ honhom ne nahorɛ nu, na sɔ mmenia nemɔ yeɛ Baba ne pena kyɛ bɛsõ ye ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nyameɛ te honhom, na bɛ bɔ bɛsõ ye ne, odikyɛ bɛsõ ye honhom ne nahorɛ nu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Maame ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mese kyɛ Mezaya bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kristo ne ba. Na ɔba a, ɔkɔmaa yekonwu nikye biala pefee.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me bɔ mene wɔ dwudwo ne, me ane.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Sɔ mmerɛ nala yeɛ ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ɔ, na ɔyɛle bɛ nwanwa kyɛ ɔne brasua dwudwo ɔ. Nakoso ebiala ammisa ye kyɛ, “Ɛpena nzu?” anaakyɛ, “Nzuati yeɛ ɛne ye dwudwo ne?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Yeti maame ne yakyile ye bua ne berɛ, na ɔhɔle kuro nanu ɔɔha hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Ɛmɔɔnea biaa bie, waha bɔ mayɛ namukoraati wahyire me. Aso nná ɛhe yeɛ ole Kristo ne?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Yeti, bɛfili kuro nanu bɛhɔle ye berɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né asuafoɛ nemɔ srɛ ye kyɛ: “Rabi, didi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nne aleɛ bie medi bɔ ɛmɔnze ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Yeti asuafoɛ nemɔ bisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Ebie aberɛ ye aleɛ ma wali anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me aleɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ngɔyɛ bɔ ɔsomane me ne apɛdeɛ, na mayie ye adwuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nnaa ɛyɛ a ɛmɔka kyɛ, waha bosome nná, ne mmerɛ aso kyɛ bɛpɛ nningyein? Nea, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ ti so bɛnea ɛboo ne, na ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ nningyein né aboro bɔ odikyɛ bɛpɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Sona bɔ ɔpɛ ne de akatua, ná ɔboɔboa mmaa ne noa kɔ daa ngoa nu; ɛhene kɔmaa bɔ odua ne bɔ ɔpɛ namukoraati nye kɔgye. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ɛhe amaa edwirɛ he ayɛ nahorɛ: Sona kõ yeɛ odua ɔ, ná kõ koso apɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Bɔ ɛmɔ anyɛ ye nwo adwuma, yeɛ nzomane ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔɔpɛ ɔ. Ebiemɔ ayɛ ye nwo adwuma, na ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ anya bɛ adwuma naso mvasoɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Maame ne adanzeɛ bɔ olili ye kyɛ, “Waha bɔ mayɛ namukoraati wahyire me” ne, ɔmaa Samariafoɛ pee bɔ bɛfi sɔ kuro nanu ne nyane gyidie wɔ Yesu nu. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ Samariafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ ne, bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ, ɔtena berɛ; ná olili ɛlɛnyɔ wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Na ye dwirɛ bɔ ɔhane nati, mmeni pee nyane ye nu gyidie, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />na bɛha bɛhyirele braa ne kyɛ: “Afei de, nná bɔ ɛhane ne ngome yeɛ wamaa yale yali ɔ; ofikyɛ yɛ bɔbɔ yate, na yanwu kyɛ biaa he yeɛ ɔte wiase agyenkwa ne.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ɛlɛnyɔ ne si ne, ofili berɛ hɔle Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Né Yesu bɔbɔ di adanzeɛ kyɛ, diifoɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ ole anuonyam wɔ ye kuro ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Na mmerɛ bɔ odwuli Galilea ne, Galileafoɛ ne lɛle ye kama, ofikyɛ afahyɛ bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Yerusalem ne, bɛhɔle bie, na bɛnwuni nningyein bɔ ɔyɛle ye wɔ afahyɛ nabo ne.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Afei osa wale Kana bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne, nekaa bɔ ɔmaa nzue kakyile nzãa ne. Né ahemvie panyi bie wɔ Kapernaum, na ne ɔwa nde apɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Mmerɛ bɔ sɔ biaa ne tele kyɛ Yesu afi Yudea awa Galilea ne, ɔhɔle ye berɛ, na ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔɔsa ɔwa né anwonyerɛ, ofikyɛ né ɔla awusu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire kyɛ: “Ne waha kaa ma akwalaa ne wu.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Na Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ de, sɛ ɛmɔ anwu nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ a, ɛmɔnne benni.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ahemvie panyi ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, bra kora ne mma ne awu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kɔ, ɛwa ne nwo atɔ ye.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛwa ne te ase.”</char></note> Biaa ne lɛle Yesu dwirɛ ne lili, na ɔhɔle. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Na ɔnate atee so ɔkɔ ne, ye ngoaa nemɔ yiale ye, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ, ɛwa ne nwo atɔ ye. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Yeti, obisale bɛ mmerɛ bɔ ye nwo tɔle ye ne. Na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Anoma, ɔbɔle eyia 1:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:52 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">1:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo.</char></note> ne, yeɛ <char style="tl">fiiva</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ebunu.”</char></note> ne hɔle ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Baba ne nwuni kyɛ sɔ mmerɛ ne yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛwa ne nwo atɔ ye” ne. Yeti, ɔne ye awurofoɛ mukoraati nyane yenu gyidie. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ɛhe yeɛ ole nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ bɔ Yesu yɛle, mmerɛ bɔ ofili Yudea wale Galilea ne.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ɛhe si ne, né Yudafoɛ ne di b'afahyɛ, na Yesu hɔle Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ne ɛkwaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ɛkwaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">te nzue bɔ ɔta neka-horɛ. (Brɔfo - </char><char style="it">Lake.</char>)</note> bie la Yerusalem Mmoan Anoa nanwo bɔ Hebri nu ne bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">Betsada</char>;<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Betsata.”</char></note> né ole varanda nnu wɔ ye nwo. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Na né mmenia pee bɔ bɛnde apɔ, bɛ nye asi, babubu, na bɛ bue awu lela berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, bafa edwirɛ bie batoa ngyekyɛmue 3 naso, yeɛ bafa ngyekyɛmue 4 koso bawura berɛ kyɛ: </char><char style="em">Bɔ bɛnwondɛ maa nzue ne ponda.</char> <char style="bd">4</char> <char style="em">Ofikyɛ odwu mmerɛ bie a, Awurade abɔfo baponda nzue ne. Sɛ nzue ne ponda a, ebiala bɔ okoli moa kɔtɔ nzue nanu ne, né ye nwo atɔ ye.</char> Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔnne asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu.</note> — <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Né biaa bie bɔ wafokyɛ afoɛ 38 wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu nwuni kyɛ sɔ biaa ne la berɛ, na ne ɔse kyɛ wafokyɛ wahyɛ. Yeti obisale ye kyɛ: “Ɛpena kyɛ wɔ nwo tɔ wɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Biaa bɔ ɔnde apɔ ne hane kyɛ: “Me wura, nnne ebiala bɔ nzue ne ponda a, ɔkɔfa me kɔto nu ɔ; na sɛ mekwaatɔ nu a, né ebie ali me nyunu moa waatɔ nu.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwɔso, fa wɔ bɛen ne, na nate.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Na ɛberɛ ala biaa ne nwo tɔle ye, ɔfale ye bɛen, na ɔhyɛle yebo natele. Né sɔ kyẽa ne te Homeda.<verse eid="JHN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Yeti, Yudafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele biaa bɔ basa ye anwonyerɛ ne kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ te Homeda, na mmeraa mma ate kyɛ ɛsoa wɔ bɛen.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Na biaa ne ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ɔsale me anwonyerɛ ne, ye ala yeɛ ɔha hyirele me kyɛ, ‘Fa wɔ bɛen na nate’ ne. ” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔha hyirele wɔ kyɛ, ‘Fa wɔ bɛen ne, na nate’ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Né biaa ne nze sona-horɛ, ofikyɛ ne Yesu afra mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ɛhene si ne, Yesu nwuni ye wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea, wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ. Nnɛyɛ bɔne kõ, na bɔ ɔtra ɛhe ando wɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Biaa ne fili berɛ ne, ɔɔbɔle Yudafoɛ nemɔ amaneɛ kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ɔsale ye anwonyerɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ɛhe ati, Yudafoɛ nemɔ tuli bɛ nye siele Yesu so, ofikyɛ né ɔyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ Homeda. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me Baba ayɛ adwuma tonn waadwu ɛnɛ, na me koso, ngɔhɔ so ngɔyɛ adwuma.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ né Yudafoɛ nemɔ nye aboro, bɔ ne bɛpena atee bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔhu ye ne, ofikyɛ nná Homeda ne ngome yeɛ obuli so ɔ, mmom ne ɔfrɛ Nyameɛ kyɛ ye Baba, na ɔyɛ ye nwo kyɛ ɔne Nyameɛ te pɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Na Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, Baa ne bɔbɔ ngora mva ye tumi nnyɛ hwee, sana bɔ okonwu kyɛ Baba ne yɛ ne. Ofikyɛ bɔ Baba ne kɔyɛ ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ Baa ne koso yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Na Baba ne kuro Baa ne dwirɛ, na nikye biala bɔ ɔyɛ ne, okyire ye, na okohyire ye nningyein bɔ ɔte mbiri tra ɛhemɔ maa ɔkɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Na kyɛbɔ Baba ne tingye awufo, ná ɔmaa benya ngoa ne, sɔ ala yeɛ Sona Awa ne kora ma bɔ okuro biala nya ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Na Baba ne nngɔbu ebiala atɛn, mmom wafa atemmuo namukoraati wawura Baa ne sa, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala koli Baa ne ni, kyɛbɔ bɛdi Baba ne ni ne. Ebiala bɔ onni Baa ne ni ne, onni Baba bɔ ɔsomane ye ne koso nni. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okotie me dwirɛ, na okole bɔ ɔsomane me ne koli ne, ole daa ngoa, na bɛngɔbu ye atɛn, mmom wafi ewue nu wahɔ ngoa nu.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />“Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmerɛ bie ba, na wadwu, bɔ awufo kɔte Nyameɛ Awa ne konvi, na bɛ bɔ bayɛ asoɛ batie ne konya ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ná kyɛbɔ Baba ne le ngoa wɔ ye bɔbɔ ye nu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ wamaa Baa ne koso anya ngoa wɔ ye bɔbɔ ye nu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Na wama ye tumi kyɛ obu atɛn, ofikyɛ ye yeɛ ɔte Sona Awa ne. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Nnɛmɔ maa ɛhe yɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa, ofikyɛ mmerɛ ne ba, ná sɔ mmerɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ ngaeɛ kumaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Asieleɛ.”</char></note> nu namukoraati kɔte ye konvi, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ná bafite. Na bɛkotingye bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle pa ne bɛkɔhɔ ngoa nu, ná batingye bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle bɔ ɔttemaye ne bahɔ atemmuo nu.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Me de, mengora memva me tumi menyɛ hwee. Bɔ mete ne yeɛ mebu ye nwo atɛn ɔ, na m'atemmuo ne tengyɛ, ofikyɛ nná bɔ mekuro yeɛ meyɛ ɔ, mmom meyɛ bɔ ɔsomane me ne apɛdeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Sɛ me ngome medi me nwo adanzeɛ a, m'adanzeɛ ne tte nahorɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ebie wɔ berɛ bɔ ye koso odi me nwo adanzeɛ ɔ, na mese kyɛ adanzeɛ bɔ odi fa me nwo ne te nahorɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ɛmɔ somane mmenia maa bɛhɔle Yohane berɛ, na olili nahorɛ nanwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ɔwɔ nu, menne adanzeɛ bɔ ofi sona berɛ mendonu, nakoso meka ɛhemɔ, ná wamaa ɛmɔ anya ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Né sɔ biaa ne te kanea bɔ ɔsɔ, ná ɔta, na ɛmɔ de, mmerɛ kaa bie yeɛ né ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔgye ɛmɔ nye wɔ ye kanea nanu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Na me de, m'adanzeɛ ne tra Yohane deɛ ne; ofikyɛ nyumaa bɔ Baba ne afa ama me kyɛ nyɛ ne, sɔ nyumaa bɔ meyɛ ne di me nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ Baba ne yeɛ wasoma me ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Na Baba bɔ ɔsomane me ne bɔbɔ di me nwo adanzeɛ. Ɛmɔ telle ye konvi lle, na kyɛbɔ ɔte ne koso, ɛmɔ nnwuni ye, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na ye dwirɛ ne nne ɛmɔ nu, ofikyɛ bɔ ɔsomane me ne, ɛmɔnne ye benni. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ɛmɔneɛnea tworɔnzɛm nanu, ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konya daa ngoa ɔ; na ɛhemɔ yeɛ odi me nwo adanzeɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Nakoso, ɛmɔ mbena kyɛ ɛmɔ ba me berɛ, ná wamaa ɛmɔ anya ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Membena anuonyam mennvi sona berɛ, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />ofikyɛ mese ye paa kyɛ, Nyameɛ nwo dɔ nne ɛmɔ nu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Me Baba dumaa nu yeɛ mmale ɔ, nakoso ɛmɔ anne me. Sɛ ebie ba ye bɔbɔ ye dumaa nu a, ye de, ɛmɔkole ye. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔpena anuonyam bɛfi ɛmɔ nwo berɛ, ná ɛmɔnne anuonyam bɔ ofi Nyameɛ komapɛ ne berɛ ne? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Nnɛmɔ nya adwene kyɛ, me yeɛ ngɔbɔ ɛmɔ sommoɛ wɔ me Baba nyunu ɔ; sona-horɛ yeɛ ɔbɔ ɛmɔ sommoɛ ɔ, yeɛ ole Mose bɔ ɛmɔ afa ɛmɔ nye bato ye so ne. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Sɛ ɛmɔlɛle Mose bɛlili a, ahaa ɛmɔkole me bɛkoli, ofikyɛ ɔhworɔle me nwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Na sɛ ɛmɔnne bɔ ɔhworɔle ne benni a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ɛmɔ alɛ́ bɔ meka ne bali?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ɛhe si ne, Yesu pɛle Galilea Po (anaa Tiberia Po) ne hɔle ye si dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Né mmeni pee li ye si, ofikyɛ bɛnwuni nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ɔyɛ fa sa mmenia anwonyerɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yeti, Yesu hɔle bokaa bie so, na ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ tenane berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yudafoɛ Pɛnu afahyɛ ne apingye. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu tole ye nye, ná onwuni kyɛ mmeni pee ba ye berɛ ne, obisale Filipo kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ yekonya paanoo yɛkɔtɔ yɛkɔma mmenia hemɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Né ɔka ɛhe fa sɔ ye nea, ofikyɛ né ɔse bɔ ɔbaayɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo hane kyɛ: “Sɛ yɛtɔ paanoo dɛnare 200 po a, ebiala ngonya kaala po ngoli.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Asuafoɛ nanu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Andrea, Simon Petro aliema ne hane kyɛ: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Abɛɛmaa bie wɔ wa bɔ ole ayuo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Baali.”</char></note> paanoo nnu, ne egyein nyɔ; nakoso ɛhe de, aso ɔkɔso mmenia nwora he?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma mmenia nemɔ tena ase.” Né nzenzaen pee wɔ berɛ, yeti mmenia ne tenane ase, né bɛ te kɔyɛ 5,000. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu fale paanoo ne, na ɔlale ase yiele ne, ɔhyɛ mane bɛ bɔ bɛte berɛ ne; sɔ ala yeɛ ɔyɛle egyein ne ɔ. Na ebiala nyane bɔ ɔkɔso ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Na bɛ ko yili ne, ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔboɔboa mbo-poro-ka ne noa, nná nikye fee anzɛkye.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Yeti, ayuo paanoo nnu bɔ mmenia nemɔ lili ne, yebo mbo-poro-ka bɔ bɛboɔboale ye noa ne, benyane ngɛndɛn 12 tɛkyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Mmerɛ bɔ mmenia ne nwuni nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ wayɛ ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Amba, ɛhe yeɛ ole diifoɛ bɔ ɔba wiase ne.”<verse eid="JHN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu nwuni kyɛ, bɛpena kyɛ bɛkye ye maa okodi hene, yeti ɔhwene ye nwo, na ye ngome, osa hɔle bokaa naso dɔ bieku.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ hɔle ɛpo ne noa dɔ, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />na bɛtenane ɛlɛen nu kyɛ bɛpɛ ɛpo ne bɛkɔ Kapernaum. Ne aleɛ asa, na ne Yesu nya walle bɛ nwo berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Né mvrama kandinga bie tu, yeti né ɛpo naso ayɛ bagya-bagya. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ bɛpɛle kɔyɛ kwanzii nza anaa nná ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ Yesu nate ɛpo naso ɔba ɛleɛn nanwo berɛ; ná esuronyi hane bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Nakoso ɔha hyire bɛ kyɛ: “Me ane, nnɛmɔ suro!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Na bɛle anigye bɛmaa ɔɔtenane ɛlɛen nanu, wangyɛ biala, ɛlɛen ne dwuli ɛpo ne noa, nekaa bɔ bɛkɔ ne.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Aleɛ hene ne, bɛ bɔ bɛhale ɛpo ne si dɔ ne nwuni kyɛ né ɛlɛen biala nne berɛ. Ɛleɛn kamba bɔ ne ɔwɔ berɛ, Yesu amvo bie, ofikyɛ asuafoɛ nemɔ ngome yeɛ bɛfo bɛhɔle ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ná ɛlɛen biemɔ fili Tiberia wale nekaa bɔ Awurade lale ase maa belili paanoo ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ ɛlɔen ne nwuni kyɛ, Yesu nne berɛ, na ye asuafoɛ nemɔ koso nne berɛ ne, bɛfole ɛlɛen bɛwale Kapernaum kyɛ bɛ baapena ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni ye wɔ ɛpo ne si dɔ ne, bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Rabi, mmerɛ beni yeɛ ɛwale wa ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, nná nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nwuni ye nati yeɛ ɛmɔpena me ne, mmom paanoo bɔ ɛmɔ lili maa ɛmɔ ko yili nati ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Nnɛmɔyɛ aleɛ bɔ ɔsɛkye nwo adwuma, mmom ɛmɔyɛ aleɛ bɔ ɔtena berɛ kɔ daa ngoa nu nwo adwuma, ɛhene yeɛ Sona Awa ne kɔfa kɔma ɛmɔ ne. Ofikyɛ ye yeɛ Baba ne, Nyameɛ bɔbɔ ahyɛ ye nzorɛ afa ahyire kyɛ wale ye wato nu ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ yɛyɛ a, né yɛ yɛ Nyameɛ adwuma ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Nyameɛ adwuma yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔkole bɔ ɔsomane ye ne bɛkoli.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzɛngyerɛneɛ beni yeɛ ɛkɔyɛ maa yekonwu ye, na yale wɔ yali ɔ? Nzu yeɛ ɛkɔyɛ ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Yɛ nana mɔ lili mana wɔ ɛserɛ naso, na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne: ‘Ɔmane bɛ paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro maa bɛlili.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, nná Mose yeɛ ɔmane ɛmɔ paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro ne, me Baba mmom yeɛ ɔmane ɛmɔ nahorɛ paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ paanoo yeɛ ole bɔ ofi anwuro ba ase, ná ɔma wiase ne ngoa ne.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Yeti bɛhane kyɛ: “Awurade, ma yɛ paanoo daa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne ngoa paanoo ne. Ebiala bɔ ɔba me berɛ ne, ɛhɔen nngohu ye lle, na ebiala bɔ onya gyidie wɔ me nu ne, nzuhɔen nngohu ye lle. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Na kyɛbɔ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ ne, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ ɛmɔ anwu me, nakoso, ɛmɔnne me benni. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Bɛ bɔ Baba ne afa bɛ ama me ne, bɛ mukoraati bɛkɔwa me berɛ; na ebiala bɔ ɔba me berɛ ne, mengɔfoa ye lle; <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />ofikyɛ mvili anwuro mmale kyɛ, mebaayɛ bɔ ɔsomane me ne apɛdeɛ, nná me bɔbɔ m'apɛdeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na bɔ ɔsomane me ne apɛdeɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɔ wafa wama me namukoraati, ngɔnea kyɛ komapɛ po ngomini, mmom kyẽa bɔ oli siɛ ne, ngotingye bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Na bɔ me Baba kuro yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okonwu Baa ne, na okonya gyidie wɔ ye nu ne, okonya daa ngoa. Na kyẽa bɔ oli siɛ ne, ngotingye ye.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ɔnate kyɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro” nati, Yudafoɛ nemɔ hyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛdwudwo. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Na bɛhane kyɛ: “Nná Yosef awa Yesu, bɔ yɛse ye baba ne ye maame ne ɛhe? Ye de, ɔwale ye sɛ yeɛ kesaalae de ɔka kyɛ, ‘Mvili anwuro mmale’ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Ɛmɔyakyi anwii-nwii ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Ebiala ngɔhora ngɔwa me berɛ, sana Baba bɔ ɔsomane me ne twe ye, na kyẽa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, ngotingye ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Bahworɔ ye wɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ nu kyɛ: ‘Nyameɛ kohyirehyire bɛ mu.’ Na ebiala bɔ watie Baba ne, na wasua nikye wafi ye berɛ ne, ɔba me berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Nná kyɛ ebie anwu Baba ne; bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne ngome yeɛ wanwu Baba ne ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okole koli ne, ole daa ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Me yeɛ nne ngoa paanoo ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ɛmɔ nana mɔ lili mana wɔ ɛserɛ naso, nakoso bɛwuli. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ɛhe yeɛ ole paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro wale kyɛ ebiala li, na wannwu ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Me yeɛ nne ngoa paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro wale ne, sɛ ebie di sɔ paanoo he a, ɔkɔtena ase daa. Na bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, paanoo bɔ ngɔfa ngɔma ye ne yeɛ ole me nwonaen, bɔ ngɔfa ngɔma ngole wiase ne ngoa ne.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ɛhe maa Yudafoɛ nemɔ suli bɛ nwo aporowaa, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né akoaa he ahora afa ye nwonaen ama yɛ kyɛ yɛli?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yeti Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔ anni Sona Awa ne nwonaen, ná ɛmɔ anno ye mogya a, ɛmɔlle ngoa wɔ ɛmɔ nu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Ebiala bɔ okoli me nwonaen na ɔkɔno me mogya ne, ole daa ngoa, na kyẽa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, ngotingye ye; <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />ofikyɛ me nwonaen ne te aleɛ bɔ bɛdi ɔ, na me mogya te anonneɛ bɔ bɛno ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ebiala bɔ odi me nwonaen na ɔno me mogya ne, ɔne me ayɛ kõ, na me koso, mene ye ayɛ kõ. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Na kyɛbɔ Baba bɔ ɔte ase ne somane me, na yeti nde ase ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɔ odi me nwonaen ne koso, me ti ɔkɔtena ase ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ɛhe yeɛ ole paanoo bɔ ofi anwuro wale ne. Ɔtte kyɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nana mɔ lili, nakoso bɛwuli ne. Ebiala bɔ okoli paanoo he ne, ɔkɔtena ase daa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ɔhane sɔ dwirɛ he, mmerɛ bɔ ne ɔyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu wɔ Kapernaum ne.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne, ye asuafoɛ nanu pee hane kyɛ: “Sɔ dwirɛ he de, yenoa yɛ hye, nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kotie ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Nakoso, né Yesu anwu kyɛ ɛhe ati, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ nwiinwii, yeti obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛhe ato ɛmɔ sintidua hɔ? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Na sɛ ɛmɔnwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne fo kɔ nekaa bɔ ofi wale ne koso ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Honhom ne yeɛ ɔma ngoa ɔ; na anwoɔnaen ne de, ɔtte hwee. Edwirɛ bɔ maha mahyire ɛmɔ ne te honhom, na ɔte ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Nakoso, ɛmɔ nu biemɔ nne nni.” Ná ahyɛaseɛ pɛɛ ne, né Yesu se bɛ bɔ benne benni, ɔne bɔ ɔkɔye ye kɔma ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Ɛhe ati yeɛ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala ngɔhora ngɔwa me berɛ, sana Baba ne ama ye atee ne.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ɛhe ati, ye asuafoɛ nanu pee sa hɔle nningyein bɔ bɛyakyile ye bɛ si nanwo, na bɛne ye annate kõ. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yeti, Yesu bisale buru-ne-nyɔ ne kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔkɔ anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simon Petro yele ye noa kyɛ: “Awurade, nwa berɛ yeɛ yɛhɔ ɔ? Wɔ yeɛ ɛle edwirɛ bɔ ɔma daa ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Yale yali, ná yanwu ye kyɛ, wɔ yeɛ ɛle Krongroniɛ bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnaa me yeɛ nyele ɛmɔ buru-ne-nyɔ he ɔ? Nakoso ɛmɔ nu kõ te abɔnzam.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ebie bɔ ɔsɛkye mmenia dumaa.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Simon Iskariot awa Yuda yeɛ ne ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ne, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ né ɔboka buru-ne-nyɔ naso, nakoso né ɔkɔye ye kɔma.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, Yesu hɔle so hyinini Galilea, né ɔmbena kyɛ ɔkɔ Yudea, ofikyɛ né Yudafoɛ nemɔ pena ye ku ye. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yudafoɛ Apata Afahyɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Asese Afahyɛ.”</char></note> ne apingye. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Yeti oliema nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Fi wa, na kɔ Yudea, ná wamaa w'asuafoɛ nemɔ anwu nningyein bɔ ɛyɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔyɛ nikye maa mmenia nwu ye ne, ɔnyɛ mvea. Sɛ ɛyɛ ɛhemɔ a, ye de, da wɔ nwo ali kyire wiase ne.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, oliema nemɔ po, né benne ye benni. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yeti Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me mmerɛ nya sonne, na ɛmɔ de, daa ɛmɔle mmerɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ɛmɔ de, ewiase ne ngora ndane ɛmɔ, nakoso me de, ɔtane me, ofikyɛ medi ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ ye nneyɛɛ te bɔne. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔhɔ afahyɛ nabo, me de mengɔhɔ, ofikyɛ me mmerɛ nya sonne.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ɔhane sɔ dwirɛ ne hyirele bɛ yiele ne, ɔtenane Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Oliema nemɔ hɔle afahyɛ nabo ne si ne, ye koso ɔhɔle dɔ, nakoso wannye ye nwo ali, mmom ɔfale ye nwo feale. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Yeti Yudafoɛ nemɔ hyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛpena ye wɔ afahyɛ nabo, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɔwɔ nisua?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Né mmenia ne yɛ ye nwo nwuhu-nwuhu paa. Ebiemɔ nwa: “Ɔte sona pa.” Ebiemɔ koso nwa: “Daabi. Ɔlaka-laka mmenia.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Nakoso Yudafoɛ nemɔ nwo suronyi ti, ebiala anye ye nyunu anga ye nwo dwirɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Bɛdwuli afahyɛ ne afia ne, Yesu hɔle asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔhyɛle yebo hyirehyirele. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yudafoɛ nemɔ nwo dwirili bɛ paa, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Biaa he suanne nwomaa biala, ye de ɔwale ye sɛ yeɛ ɔse tworɔnzɛm nanu sɔ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Bɔ mekyirekyire ne, ɔtte me deɛ, ɔte bɔ ɔsomane me ne deɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ ɔyɛ Nyameɛ apɛdeɛ a, okonwu kyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ ne fi Nyameɛ berɛ, anaa me bɔbɔ yeɛ mebɔ me ti anu me dwudwo ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Ebiala bɔ ɔbɔ ye ti anu dwudwo ne, ɔpena ye bɔbɔ ye anuonyam; nakoso bɔ ɔpena anuonyam fi bɔ ɔsomane ye ne berɛ ne, ye yeɛ odi nahorɛ ɔ, ná nikye bɔ ɔndengyɛ biala nne ye nu. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Nnaa Mose yeɛ ɔfale mmeraa ne mane ɛmɔ ɔ? Nakoso ɛmɔ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ odi mmeraa naso ɔ. Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔpena me bɛku me ne?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Mmenia ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛle sunzummɔne. Nwa yeɛ ɔpena wɔ ku wɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu koso buale bɛ kyɛ: “Anwanwadeɛ komapɛ bɔ mayɛ ne, ɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ Mose hane kyɛ ɛmɔpɛ ɛmɔ toa ne, (wanhyɛ yebo wɔ Mose so, mmom ɛmɔ nana mɔ aberɛ so), na homeda po, ɛmɔpɛ sona toa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Na sɛ ɛmɔpɛ ebie toa homeda, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ongobu Mose mmeraa naso a, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ afɛ me so yaa kyɛ, mamaa sona nwo atɔ ye koraa homeda ne? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Atɛn bɔ ɛmɔgyina bɔ otua anyeɛ so bɛbu ne, ɛmɔyakyi, ná ɛmɔbu atɛn tenenee.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Afei, bɛ bɔ bɛtete Yerusalem ne bie hane kyɛ: “Nná biaa he yeɛ bɛpena ye bɛku ye ne? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nakoso nea, ogyi petee nu odwudwo, na bɛnga hwee bengyire ye. Anaa mbanyi nemɔ anwu ye kyɛ yeɛ ole Kristo ne? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Biaa he de, yɛse nekaa bɔ ofi ɔ; nakoso Kristo ne de, ɔba a, ebiala ngonwu nekaa bɔ ofi ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Na Yesu gu so okyirekyire wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Ɛmɔse me, na ɛmɔse nekaa bɔ mvi ɔ. Nakoso, nná me bɔbɔ mepɛ yeɛ mva mmale ɔ, Bɔ ɔsomane me ne wɔ berɛ paa, na ye de, ɛmɔnze ye. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Me de mese ye, mvi ye berɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmale kyɛ mebaasi ye gya nu.”</char></note> na ye yeɛ ɔsomane me ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Yeti, ne bɛpena atee bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔhye ye, nakoso ebiala amva ye sa anga ye, ofikyɛ né ye mmerɛ nya sonne. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Nakoso, mmenia nanu pee nyane gyidie wɔ ye nu, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Sɛ Kristo ne ba a, ɔkɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ɔtra biaa he deɛ ne anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Farisifoɛ nemɔ tele kyɛ mmenia ne keka sɔ dwirɛ ne fa ye nwo, yeti sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ somane sogyafoɛ kyɛ bɛɛhye ye. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mene ɛmɔ kɔtena ɛwa kaa kora ne mahɔ bɔ ɔsomane me ne berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ɛmɔ kɔpena me, nakoso ɛmɔ ngonwu me, na nekaa bɔ ngɔhɔ ne, ɛmɔ ngɔhora berɛ ba.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Nakoso, né Yudafoɛ nemɔ keka kyire bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ biaa he pena kyɛ ɔkɔ bɔ yeti, yɛngonwu ye ne? Yudafoɛ bɔ babɔ basande Greek ne yeɛ ɔpena kyɛ ɔkɔ bɛ dɔ kɔkyirekyire bɛ anaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔ kɔpena me, nakoso ɛmɔ ngonwu me, na nekaa bɔ ngɔhɔ ne, ɛmɔ ngɔhora berɛ ba’ ne, né ɔpena kyire sɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Na kyẽa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo, bɔ ɔte kyẽa piri wɔ afahyɛ nanu ne, Yesu dwɔso gyinane berɛ, na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Sɛ nzuhɔen ku ebie a, ɔbra me berɛ ɔɔno nzue. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ebiala bɔ okonya gyidie wɔ me nu ne, kyɛbɔ tworɔnzɛm ne ka ne: ‘Ye ahone nu tɔnn yeɛ ngoa nzue kɔtengyɛ ɔ.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Nakoso ɛhe bɔ Yesu hane ne de, né ɔfa honhom bɔ ebie nya gyidie wɔ ye nu a, okonya ye nanwo. Sɔ mmerɛ ne de, né honhom ne nya walle, ofikyɛ ne bɛhyɛlle ye anuonyam.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Mmenia ne tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, na bɛ nu biemɔ hane kyɛ: “Amba, ɛhe yeɛ ole diifoɛ ne.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ebiemɔ koso hane kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ ole Kristo ne.” Nakoso ebiemɔ bisale kyɛ: “Galilea yeɛ Kristo ne kofi kɔwa anaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Aso tworɔnzɛm ne nga kyɛ Kristo ne kofi David abusua nu, na okofi Betlehem, nnamue bɔ ne David te nu nanu?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Na yeti, mmenia nanu hyɛle. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ né ebiemɔ pena kyɛ bɛkye ye, nakoso ebiala angora amva ye sa anga ye.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Sogyafoɛ ne sa hɔle sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ ne berɛ; na bɛbisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ amva ye bamma ne?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Sogyafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ wadwudwo kyɛ biaa he lle.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Yeɛ Farisifoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ koso, nnaa ɛmɔ amaa walaka-laka ɛmɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ atumvoɛ ne anaa Farisifoɛ nanu bie anya ye nu gyidie? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Mmenia hemɔ bɔ bɛnze mmeraa ne de, badome bɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Na Nikodemo bɔ mmerɛ bie ɔhɔle ye berɛ ne, né ɔte Farisiniɛ, na obisale bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Aso yɛ mmeraa ne kora bu ebie atɛn, mmerɛ bɔ yɛtielle ye noa dwirɛ, na yɛnwuni bɔ ɔyɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bɛmane ye mmuayɛ kyɛ: “Wɔ koso, efi Galilea anaa? Neɛnea nu nea, na ekonwu kyɛ diifoɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ okofi Galilea kɔwa ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="iex">Sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a,edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Yohane 7:53 kosi 8:11 ne, ɔnne nu. Yeti ɛkora nwu kyɛ ebia ye si ne, yeɛ ebiemɔ fa wurale nu ɔ.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />
    <char style="em">Na bɛ nu biala hɔle ye awuro.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />
    <char style="em">Nakoso Yesu hɔle Olive Bokaa naso.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" /><char style="em">Na ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu ne, osa wale asɔre awuro berɛ. Mmenia namukoraati wale ye nwo berɛ, yeti ɔtenane ase, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ okyirekyire bɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" /><char style="em">Afei, atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ fale maame bie wale ye berɛ, né baahye ye kyɛ ɔbɔ adwaman; na bɛmaa ogyinane mmenia nemɔ afia,</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" /><char style="em">yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yaahye maame he kyɛ ɔbɔ adwaman.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" /><char style="em">Sɛ ɛnea mmeraa nanu a, Mose hane kyɛ, yɛsi ebie bɔ ɔte sɔ ne nyɔboɛ; na wɔ koso, ɛnwu ye sɛ?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" /><char style="em">Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, né bɛka ɛhe bɛfa bɛsɔ ye bɛnea, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonya nikye bie bɛkogyina so bɛkɔbɔ ye kwaadu. Yesu kunduni berɛ, na ɔfale ye sa hworɔ-hworɔle aseɛ nwo berɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" /><char style="em">Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛgu ye so wɔ edwirɛ nanwo ne, ɔtengyɛle ye nu, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ nu biala bɔ ɔyɛlle bɔne lle ne, oli moa to nyɔboɛ ne bɔ ye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" /><char style="em">Osa kunduni berɛ, na ɔfale ye sa hworɔ-hworɔle aseɛ nwo berɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" /><char style="em">Bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɛfili berɛ ngoko-ngoko maa ɔhale maame ne ngome; mbanyi nemɔ yeɛ bɛli moa bɛhɔle ɔ, na ɔhale maame ne ngome wɔ Yesu nwo berɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" /><char style="em">Yesu tengyɛle ye nu, na ɔha hyirele maame ne kyɛ: “Maame, bɛwɔ nisua? Ebiala ammu wɔ fɔ kõ?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" /><char style="em">Ɔyele ye noa kyɛ: “Me wura, ebiala ammu me fɔ.” Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ye de, me koso, mengɔbu wɔ fɔ. Kɔ, ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, nnɛyɛ bɔne kõ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu sa ha hyirele bɛ bieku kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne wiase kanea. Ebiala bɔ okoli me si ne, ɔngɔnate awosii nu lle, mmom okonya ngoa kanea.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Yeti Farisifoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ ɛdi wɔ nwo adanzeɛ ɔ, wɔ adanzeɛ ne, ɔtte nahorɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu koso buale bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ me bɔbɔ medi me nwo adanzeɛ po a, m'adanzeɛ ne te nahorɛ; ofikyɛ mese nekaa bɔ mvi ɔ, na mese nekaa bɔ mekɔ ɔ. Na ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnze nekaa bɔ mvi, ne nekaa bɔ mekɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Sona adwene yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛbu atɛn ɔ, na me de memmu ebiala atɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Na sɛ mebu atɛn po a, m'atemmuo ne te nahorɛ, ofikyɛ ɔhalle me ngome, Baba bɔ ɔsomane me ne boka me so. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Afei, bahworɔ ye wɔ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ mmeraa nanu kyɛ: ‘Mmenia nyɔ adanzeɛ te nahorɛ.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Me bɔbɔ medi me nwo adanzeɛ, na Baba bɔ ɔsomane me ne koso di me nwo adanzeɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ Baba ne wɔ nisua?” Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Kyɛbɔ ɛmɔnze me ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔnze me Baba ne ɔ. Sɛ ɛmɔse me a, ahaa ɛmɔ konwu me Baba ne koso.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ɔhane sɔ dwirɛ ne, mmerɛ bɔ ne okyirekyire wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, na né ogyi nekaa bɔ bɛye ndoboa ne. Nakoso ebiala angye ye, ofikyɛ né ye mmerɛ nya sonne.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yeti osa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me de mekɔ, na ɛmɔ kɔpena me, nakoso ɛmɔ kowu ɛmɔ bɔne nu. Nekaa bɔ mekɔ ne, ɛmɔ ngɔhora berɛ ba.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Yeti, Yudafoɛ nemɔ hyɛle yebo hane kyɛ: “Ɔkwaahu ye nwo hɔ? Ofikyɛ yenwa, ‘Nekaa bɔ mekɔ ne, ɛmɔ ngɔhora berɛ ba.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu toale so ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔfi ase, na me de, mvi anwuro. Ɛmɔfi wiase he anu; na me de mmvi wiase he anu. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔ kowu ɛmɔ bɔne nu’ ne. Na sɛ ɛmɔ anne banni kyɛ me yeɛ nne ye a, ɛmɔ kowu ɛmɔ bɔne nu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Yeti, bɛhyɛle yebo bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa?” Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ ahyɛaseɛ ne, nga ngyirele ɛmɔ nala.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nzuati po yeɛ mene ɛmɔ dwudwo ne?”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nne edwirɛ pee bɔ odikyɛ meka mefa ɛmɔ nwo ɔ, na nne nningyein pee bɔ odikyɛ mebu ye nwo atɛn ɔ. Nakoso bɔ ɔsomane me ne te ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ, na bɔ mete mefi ye berɛ ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ meka ye wɔ wiase ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Bannwu ye kyɛ, ye Baba nwo dwirɛ yeɛ né ɔka kyire bɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yeti, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnya bɛma Sona Awa naso a, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛmɔ konwu ye kyɛ me yeɛ nne ye, na nná me bɔbɔ mepɛ yeɛ mefa meyɛ nikye bie ɔ, mmom bɔ Baba ne hyirele me ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ meka ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Na bɔ ɔsomane me ne boka me so, wanyakyi me ngome, ofikyɛ daa biala, meyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ ye nye.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ogu so ɔka sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ ne, mmeni pee nyane gyidie wɔ ye nu.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yeti, Yudafoɛ bɔ banya gyidie wɔ Yesu nu ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔfa me dwirɛ bɛyɛ adwuma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sɛ ɛmɔ tena me dwirɛ nu.”</char></note> a, né ɔte amba kyɛ ɛmɔte m'asuafoɛ, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />na ɛmɔ konwu nahorɛ ne, na nahorɛ ne kɔmaa ɛmɔkole ɛmɔ nwo.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nahorɛ ne kɔye ɛmɔ kofi ngoasom nu.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Yɛte Abraham bosofoɛ, na yɛyɛlle ngoaa yɛmanne ebiala lle. Ye de nzuati yeɛ ɛka kyire yɛ kyɛ ‘Yɛkole yɛ nwo’ ne?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔne ne, ɔte bɔne akoaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Afei, akoaa ndena awuro berɛ daa, baa yeɛ ɔtena berɛ daa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Yeti sɛ Baa ne maa ɛmɔdɛ ɛmɔ nwo a, afei de né ɛmɔtte ngoaa kõ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Né ɔte amba kyɛ ɛmɔ alɛ́ ɛmɔ nwo.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Mese kyɛ ɛmɔte Abraham bosofoɛ, nakoso, ɛmɔpena me bɛku me, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnne edwirɛ bɔ meka ne bɛndonu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Bɔ nwuni ye wɔ me Baba berɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ meka ɔ; na ɛmɔ de, bɔ ɛmɔ ate bafi ɛmɔ baba berɛ yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bɛyele yenoa kyɛ: “Yɛ Baba yeɛ ole Abraham.” Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔte Abraham mmaa mɔ a, ahaa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ bɔ Abraham yɛle ne bie. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nakoso kesaalae de, ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔ ku me, sona bɔ maha nahorɛ bɔ mate mafi Nyameɛ berɛ ne mahyire ɛmɔ ne. Abraham de, wanyɛ sɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Bɔ ɛmɔ Baba yɛ ne, ɛhene biala yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ.” Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yɛ de, yɛtte adwaman mmaa, yɛ Baba te komapɛ, yeɛ ole Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔ Baba yeɛ ole Nyameɛ a, ahaa ɛmɔdɔ me, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ berɛ yeɛ mvi mmale wa ɔ. Nná me bɔbɔ mepɛ yeɛ mva mmale ɔ, mmom Ye yeɛ ɔsomane me ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔnde bɔ meka nabo ne? Ɔnate kyɛ, ɛmɔngora bɛndie me dwirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ Baba Abɔnzam berɛ, na ɛmɔ kuro kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔ ɛmɔ baba ne kuro ɔ. Ye de, ɔte wudiniɛ fi ahyɛaseɛ, na wangyina nahorɛ nanu, ofikyɛ nahorɛ ne nne ye nu. Sɛ ɔpɛ anoanu a, ye bɔbɔ ye suban yeɛ wamaa wayɛ sɔ ɔ, ofikyɛ ɔte ngondomboniɛ, ne ngondombo baba. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Na ɔnate kyɛ me de, meka nahorɛ nati, ɛmɔnne me benni. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kobu me fɔ kyɛ mayɛ bɔne ɔ? Na sɛ nahorɛ yeɛ meka a, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔnne me benni ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ebiala bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne, otie Nyameɛ dwirɛ. Na ɛhene ati yeɛ ɛmɔ ndie me ne, ofikyɛ nná Nyameɛ berɛ yeɛ ɛmɔfi ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Yɛhane kyɛ ɛte Samarianiɛ, na ɛle sunzummɔne, nnaa anwu ye kyɛ ɔte nahorɛ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Nnne sunzummɔne, mmom me Baba yeɛ medi ye ni ɔ, na ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔgua me nyunu ase. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Afei, membena anuonyam memma me nwo, Ebie wɔ berɛ bɔ ɔpena anuonyam ma me ɔ, na ye yeɛ obu atɛn ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okoli me dwirɛ so ne, ongowu koraa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bekye bɔ yanwu kyɛ sãa ɛle sunzummɔne ɔ. Abraham wuli, na adiifoɛ nemɔ koso wuli, nakoso wɔ de ɛnwa, ‘ebiala bɔ okoli me dwirɛ so ne, ongowu koraa.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ɛte piri tra yɛ nana Abraham bɔ owuli ne? Adiifoɛ nemɔ koso, nnaa bɛwuli. W'adwene yɛ wɔ kyɛ ɛte nzu deinn?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ mehyɛ me nwo anuonyam a, me anuonyam ne tte hwee. Me Baba bɔ ɛmɔnwa ɔte ɛmɔ Nyameɛ ne, ye yeɛ ɔhyɛ me anuonyam ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nakoso ɛmɔnze ye, me de mese ye. Sɛ meka kyɛ menze ye a, né mayɛ ngondomboniɛ te kyɛ ɛmɔ ala. Nakoso mese ye, na medi ye dwirɛ so. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Né ɔyɛ ɛmɔ Baba Abraham fɛ kyɛ okonwu me ngyẽa ne, onwuni ye, na olili ahurusi paa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Afoɛ 50 po ɛnyane ye, ye de, ɔyɛle sɛɛ yeɛ ɛnwuni Abraham ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, kora bɔ bɛwo Abraham ne, né nwɔ berɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Yeti, bɛfale nyɔboɛ kyɛ bɛto bɛbɔ ye, nakoso Yesu feale na ofili asɔre awuro berɛ hɔle.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ɔpɛnu ne, onwuni abrandeɛ bie bɔ bɛwole ye ne, né ye nye asi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Yeti, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ bisale ye kyɛ: “Rabi, nwa yeɛ ɔyɛle bɔne bɔ yeti bɛwole ye ne, né ye nye asi ne? Abrandeɛ ne, anaa ye awofo?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Biaa he yɛlle bɔne, na ye awofo koso yɛlle bɔne biala, mmom wawa ye sɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonwu Nyameɛ nyumaa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Aleɛ ahe ye de, odikyɛ yɛyɛ Bɔ ɔsomane me ne adwuma, aleɛ baasa bɔ ebiala ngɔhora adwuma biala yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Mmerɛ bɔ nwɔ wiase ne de, me yeɛ nde wiase ne kanea ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ɔhane sɔ dwirɛ nemɔ yiele ne, ɔtele ngɔserɛ guale ase, na ɔfa frale nnɛterɛ, yeɛ ɔfa yɛle abrandeɛ ne nye naso ɔ, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kɔ Siloam nzue nanwo, na kɔnwunzi,” (Siloam ne bo kyire “Basoma”). Yeti ɔɔwunzini, ná ɔba ne, né onwu nikye. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ɛhe ati mandanu berɛfoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛnwuni kyɛ né ɔsrɛ-srɛ nikye ne hyɛle yebo hane kyɛ: “Nná biaa he yeɛ né ɔtena ase srɛ-srɛ nikye ne?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ebiemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ye ane.” Yeɛ ebiemɔ koso nwa: “Nná ye ɔ, mmom osoma ye.” Nakoso biaa ne de, bɔ né ɔka ala yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Me ane oo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Ɔyɛle sɛɛ yeɛ wɔ nye tele ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yesu yeɛ ɔfale ngɔserɛ frale nnɛterɛ fa yɛle me nye naso ɔ, na ɔha hyirele me kyɛ, ‘Kɔnwunzi ye wɔ Siloam nu.’ Yeti ngɔnwunzini, na me nye ne tele.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Yeti, bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Sɔ biaa ne wɔ ni?” Na ɔhane kyɛ: “Menze oo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Na bɛfale abrandeɛ bɔ né ye nye asi ne bɛhɔle Farisifoɛ nemɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kyẽa bɔ Yesu fale ngɔserɛ frale nnɛterɛ fa tele abrandeɛ ne nye ne, sãa né ɔte Homeda. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Yeti, Farisifoɛ nemɔ koso bisale abrandeɛ ne bɔ osili, bɔ kesaalae de onwu nikye ne. Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔfale nnɛterɛ yɛle me nye naso, yeɛ ngɔnwunzini ɔ, ɛhene yeɛ ɔmaa nwuni nikye ne.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Yeti Farisifoɛ nemɔ bie hane kyɛ: “Sɔ biaa he, offi Nyameɛ berɛ, ofikyɛ onni Homeda.” Yeɛ ebiemɔ koso hane kyɛ: “Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ, né ebie bɔ ɔte ɔbɔnefoɛ ayɛ sɔ nzɛngyerɛneɛ he?” Yeti, né bɛ nu ahyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Besa bɛbisale abrandeɛ bɔ né ye nye asi kyɛ: “Kesaalae bɔ wate wɔ nye ne, nzu yeɛ ɛka fa ye nwo ɔ?” Abrandeɛ ne hane kyɛ: “Ɔte diifoɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Nakoso, Yudafoɛ nemɔ anne anni kyɛ né ye nye asi, yeɛ kesaalae de wanwu nikye oodwuli kyɛ bɛfrɛle sɔ abrandeɛ ne awofo bɛwale ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Yeɛ bɛbisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ awa he, yeɛ ɛmɔnwa bɛwole ye ne, né ye nye asi ne? Ye de, ɔwale ye sɛ yeɛ onwu nikye ne?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ye awofo nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Yɛ de yɛ se kyɛ yɛ wa ɛhe, na yɛwole ye ne, né ye nye asi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Na bɔ ɔyɛle a kesaalae de onwu nikye ne de, yɛnze; na sona bɔ ɔtele ye nye ne koso, yɛnze ye. Wanyi, ɛmɔ bisa ye, ye bɔbɔ ɔkodwudwo kɔma ye nwo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Né ye awofo ne suro Yudafoɛ nemɔ, yeti yeɛ bɛhane sɔ ne. Né Yudafoɛ nemɔ abɔ porɛ kyɛ, sɛ ebie nze, na ɔka kyɛ ye yeɛ ɔte Kristo ne a, odikyɛ bɛtu sɔ sona ne bɛfi sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ ye awofo ne hane kyɛ: “Wanyi, ɛmɔ bisa ye” ne.<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Yeti, besa bɛfrɛle abrandeɛ bɔ né ye nye asi ne bieku, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Hyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam, yɛ de yɛse kyɛ sɔ biaa he te ɔbɔnefoɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Sɛ ɔte ɔbɔnefoɛ de a, menze. Nikye komapɛ yeɛ mese ɔ, yeɛ ole kyɛ, né me nye asi, nakoso kesaalae de menwu nikye.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɔfa yɛle wɔ ɔ? Atee beni yeɛ ɔfale so tele wɔ nye ne?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Maha mahyire ɛmɔ dada, nakoso ɛmɔ andie. Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔte ye bieku ɔ? Anaa ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ ye asuafoɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Yeti bɛpepɛle ye nzoaa, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛte sɔ biaa ne suaniɛ ɔ, yɛ de yɛte Mose asuafoɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Yɛse kyɛ Nyameɛ adwudwo ahyire Mose, nakoso biaa he de, yɛnze nekaa bɔ ofi ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Yeɛ abrandeɛ ne hane kyɛ: “Ɛhe koso de ɔyɛ nwanwa oo, ɛmɔnze nekaa bɔ ofi ɔ, nakoso wate me nye. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Yɛse kyɛ Nyameɛ ndie abɔnefoɛ, mmom sɛ ebie suro Nyameɛ, na ɔyɛ bɔ okuro de a, otie ye. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ofi teteete bɔ ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ, yɛtelle ye lle kyɛ, ebie ahora ate ebie bɔ bɛwole ye anyesiniwaa nye. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Sɛ nná Nyameɛ berɛ yeɛ biaa he fi a, ahaa ɔngɔhora ngɔyɛ hwee.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bɛ koso bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔ bɔne nu ngome yeɛ bɛwole wɔ ne, wɔ yeɛ ɛbaahyirehyire yɛ ɔ?” Yeti bɛfoane ye bɛfili berɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu tele kyɛ bafoa ye, na mmerɛ bɔ onwuni ye ne, obisale ye kyɛ: “Edɛ́ Sona Awa ne di?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yeɛ abrandeɛ ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, yeɛ ole nwa, na nne ye nni?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Anwu ye, bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ye yeɛ ɔne wɔ dwudwo ne.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Awurade, medɛ́ ye medi.” Na ɔbɔle ye nu ase kotole ye. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Atemmuo he ati yeɛ mmale wiase ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bɛ nye asi ne konwu nikye, na bɛ bɔ bɛnwu nikye ne nye asi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Farisifoɛ bɔ ne bɛwɔ berɛ ne bie tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yɛ koso, yɛ nye asi anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔ nye asi a, ahaa bɔne nne ɛmɔ nwo. Nakoso kesaalae, ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔka kyɛ, ‘Yɛ nwu nikye’ nati, ɛmɔ bɔne ne aha berɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔmva anoa nanu ngɔ mmoan tuin nanu, na ɔfa nekaa foforɛ fo kɔ nu ne, ɔte awieniɛ, na ɔfẽ nningyein. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Nakoso, bɔ ɔfa anoa nanu kɔ nu ne de, ye yeɛ ɔnea mmoan ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Ye de, bɔ ɔte anoa ne noa ne se ye, na mmoan ne tie ye konvi. Na ɔfa ye mmoan ne bɔbɔ dumaa frɛ bɛ, na odi bɛ nyunu fa bɛ fite. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Sɛ ɔfa ye mmoan namukoraati fite a, odi bɛ nyunu, na mmoan ne di ye si, ofikyɛ bɛse ye konvi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ɛwɔfoɛ de, bɛngoli ye si lle, mmom bɛkɔnwati bɛkofi ye nwo, ofikyɛ bɛnze ɛwɔfoɛ konvi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu buli bɛ anyandera, nakoso bannde bɔ ne ɔka kyire bɛ nabo. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yeti, Yesu sa hane ye bieku kyɛ: “Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, me yeɛ nne mmoan nemɔ anoa ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bɛ bɔ bɛlili me nyunu bɛwale namukoraati te awiefoɛ, na bɛfẽ nningyein; nakoso mmoan ne andie bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Me yeɛ nne anoa ne, ebiala bɔ ɔfa me nu kɔ nu ne, okonya ngoa, ɔkɔhɔ nu kɔwa, na okonya nekaa kodidi. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Awieniɛ de, ɔba a, né ɔbaawia nikye, ɔbaahu ebie, na ɔsɛkye nikye. Na me de mmale, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonya ngoa, na banya ye maa wabo so. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Me yeɛ nne mmoan-neafoɛ pa ne, mmoan-neafoɛ pa ne de, ɔfa ye ngoa to berɛ ma ye mmoan ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Paaniɛ ne de, nná ye yeɛ ɔnea mmoan ne ɔ, ná mmoan ne tte ye deɛ, yeti sɛ onwu kyɛ pataku ba a, ɔyakyi mmoan ne berɛ nwati maa pataku ne bakye bɛ, na ɔbɔ bɛ sande. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Paaniɛ ne nwati, ofikyɛ babɔ ye paa, na mmoan ne nwo nhia ye. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Me yeɛ nne mmoan-neafoɛ pa ne, mese me mmoan, na me mmoan koso se me, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kyɛbɔ mese Baba ne, na Baba ne koso se me nala; na mefa me ngoa meto berɛ mema mmoan ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nne mmoan foforɛ bɔ benne tuin he anu. Odikyɛ mefa bɛ meba nu maa bɛbatie me konvi, ná bayɛ kue kõ, banya sona kõ bɔ ɔnea bɛ so ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ Baba ne dɔ me ne, ofikyɛ mefa me ngoa meto berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mesa kɔha ye bieku ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Ebiala ngora nne mvi me sa nu, me bɔbɔ yeɛ mefa meto berɛ ɔ. Nne tumi kyɛ mefa meto berɛ, na nne tumi kyɛ mesa mefa. Ahyɛdeɛ he yeɛ me Baba fa mane me ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Sɔ dwirɛ he ati, Yudafoɛ nanu sa hyɛle bieku. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bɛ nu pee hane kyɛ: “Ole sunzummɔne, na wabɔ laen. Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔtie ye ne?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Nakoso ebiemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ebie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so ngɔhora ngɔha sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ. Sunzummɔne kɔhora kɔte anyesiniwaaniɛ nye?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né bɛdi Afahyɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛhyira Asɔre Awuro naso ne wɔ Yerusalem, na né ɔte ayirɛ mmerɛ, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />né Yesu nate-nate asɔre awuro berɛ, né ɔnate Solomon varanda naso. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ pɛle ye nwo yiale ɔ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛma yɛnwondɛ yɛkodwu kyinzu? Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne a, ka ye pen kyire yɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Maha mahyire ɛmɔ, nakoso ɛmɔnne benni. Nningyein bɔ meyɛ ye wɔ me Baba dumaa nu ne, odi me nwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Nakoso ɛmɔnne benni, ofikyɛ nná me mmoan yeɛ ole ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Me mmoan tie me konvi, mese bɛ, na bɛdi me si. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ngɔma bɛ daa ngoa, na bɛngɔsɛkye lle, ná ebiala ngole bɛ ngɔfi me sa nu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Bɔ me Baba afa ama me ne, ɔte piri tra nikye biala, ná ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora kole bɛ kofi me Baba sa nu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mene Baba ne te kõ.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Yudafoɛ nemɔ sa sesale nyɔboɛ, kyɛ bɛkwaato bɛbɔ ye. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mayɛ nyumaa pa pee bɔ ofi me Baba berɛ mahyire ɛmɔ. Nyumaa nanu beni ti yeɛ ɛmɔ baaboro me nyɔboɛ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Yudafoɛ nemɔ yele ye noa kyɛ: “Nná nningyein pa bɔ ayɛ nati yeɛ yɛbaaboro wɔ nyɔboɛ ɔ, mmom abɔ mmusue; ofikyɛ ɛte sona, nakoso ɛyɛ wɔ nwo kyɛ ɛte nyameɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nná ɛmɔ mmeraa nanu yeɛ bahworɔ kyɛ: ‘Ngane kyɛ, “Ɛmɔte nyameɛ” ’ ne? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Sɛ ɔfrɛle bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne wale bɛ berɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Dwudwo tia bɛ.”</char></note> ne nyameɛ, na sɛ bɛsesã Tworɔnzɛm ne a ɔnyɛ ye a, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />nzuati yeɛ me bɔ Baba ne ate me nwo, na wafa me wawa wiase ne, meka kyɛ ‘Nde Nyameɛ Awa’ a, ‘mabɔ mmusue’ ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Sɛ nná me Baba nyumaa yeɛ meyɛ a, nnɛmɔ dɛ́ me bɛdi. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Na sɛ Baba ne nyumaa yeɛ meyɛ, ná ɛmɔnne me benni po a, nyumaa ne de, ɛmɔle bɛli. Ɛhene kɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu ye, na ɛmɔ ate yebo kyɛ, Baba ne wɔ me nu, na me koso nwɔ Baba ne nu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Yeti ahaa bɛkye ye, nakoso onwatili, na bɛ sa anga ye.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Na osa pɛle Yordan nzue ne hɔle nekaa bɔ né Yohane bɔ asu ne, na ɔɔtenane dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ná mmeni pee wale ye nwo berɛ, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Yohane anyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ komapɛ po, nakoso bɔ ɔha fale biaa he anwo namukoraati te nahorɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na mmeni pee nyane gyidie wɔ ye nu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Lazarus fokyɛle. Né ofi Betania, nekaa bɔ Mary ne oliema Marta fi ne. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mary he yeɛ ɔfale ngoo fona-fona guale Awurade nwo, na ɔfale ye ti nwiaa kyikyile ye gya bo ne, oliema brienzua Lazarus yeɛ ne wafokyɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Yeti, oliema mmrasua nemɔ tole Yesu ngraa kyɛ: “Awurade, nea, bɔ ekuro ye dwirɛ ne afokyɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ Yesu tele ɛhe ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Sɔ anwonyerɛ he, ɔtte anwonyerɛ bɔ okohu ye ɔ, mmom Nyameɛ anuonyam ti ɔ, na ɔnate ɛhe aso ne, bɛkɔhyɛ Nyameɛ Awa ne anuonyam.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Né Yesu dɔ Marta ne oliema brasua ne né Lazarus paa. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele kyɛ Lazarus afokyɛ ne, olili ɛlɛnyɔ wɔ nekaa bɔ né ɔwɔ ne. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Yesi ne, ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yesa yɛhɔ Yudea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Rabi, nná anomasi wala yeɛ ahaa Yudafoɛ nemɔ si wɔ nyɔboɛ ne, yeɛ esa kɔ dɔ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Nná dɔnhwere buru-ne-nyɔ yeɛ ɔwɔ kyẽa biala nu ɔ? Sɛ ebie nate eyia a, ɔmpoli, ofikyɛ onwu kanea bɔ ɔwɔ wiase ne. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nakoso sɛ ebie nate kɔngɔen a, ɔkɔpoli, ofikyɛ kanea nne ye nu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ɔhane ɛhemɔ yiele ne, osa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Yɛ damvo Lazarus ala, na mekɔ dɔ mekɔ tingye ye.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Yeɛ asuafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, sɛ wala de a, ye nwo kɔtɔ ye.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Nakoso Yesu de, ye wue nwo dwirɛ yeɛ ne ɔka ne, nakoso bɛ de, né b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ wala bɔ odɛ́ ye nwomeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yeti, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ pen kyɛ: “Lazarus awu, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />na ɛmɔ ti, ɔyɛ me fɛ kyɛ né nne berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔkole bɛkoli. Nakoso, ɛmɔma yɛhɔ dɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Yeti Tomas, bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Ata ne ha hyirele ye mmango asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yɛne ye hɔ, ná yɛne ye wu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu dwuli berɛ ne, onwuni kyɛ basie Lazarus maa wali ɛlɛnna. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Né Betania pingye Yerusalem, na efi Yerusalem bɔ ɛkɔ berɛ ne, ɔte kɔyɛ kwanzii nyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Né Yudafoɛ pee awa berɛ kyɛ bɛbaayɛ Marta ne Mary yaakɔ, bɛ liema ne wue nati. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Mmerɛ bɔ Marta tele kyɛ Yesu ba ne, ooyiale ye; nakoso Mary de, né ɔte awuro. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marta ha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Awurade, sɛ ɛwɔ wa a, ahaa nniema ne annwu. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Nakoso kesaalae po, mese kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ ekobisa Nyameɛ ne, Nyameɛ kɔfa kɔma wɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Eliema ne kotingye.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mese kyɛ kyẽa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo, bɔ bɛtingye awufo ne, okosa kɔdwɔso.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne ewue tingyelɛ ne ngoa. Ebiala bɔ onya gyidie wɔ me nu ne, sɛ wawu po a, okosa kɔwa ngoa nu; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />na ebiala bɔ ɔte ase, na odɛ́ me di ne, ongowu koraa. Edɛ́ ɛhe di?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marta hane kyɛ: “Yoo, Awurade, medɛ́ medi kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne, Nyameɛ Awa bɔ ɔba wiase ne.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ofili berɛ hɔle, na ɔɔfrɛle oliema Mary, yeɛ ɔha guale ye so anu kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne awa, na yenwa ɛbra.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ɔtele ɛhe ne, ɛberɛ ala yeɛ odwɔso hɔle ye dɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Né Yesu nnya dwuli nnamue nanu, né ɔtɛ́ wɔ nekaa bɔ Marta yiale ye ne. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Mary nwo berɛ bɛkyekye ye wora ne nwuni kyɛ wadwɔso kuhuru ɔkɔ ne, bɛlili ye si; né bɛse kyɛ ɔkɔ asieleɛ naso kosu. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mary dwuli nekaa bɔ Yesu wɔ, na ye nye bɔle ye so ne, ɔkotole ye gya bo, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, sɛ ɛwɔ wa a, ahaa nniema ne anwu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu nwuni kyɛ osu, ná Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛne ye wale ne su ne, ye wora bɔle paa, na ɔyɛle basaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yeti obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ ɛmɔ fale ye bɛtole ɔ?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Awurade, baanea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu suni. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Yeti Yudafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ, “Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ ne okuro ye dwirɛ ɔ!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Nakoso, bɛ nu biemɔ hane kyɛ: “Nná biaa he yeɛ ɔte anyesiniwaafoɛ nye ne? Yeɛ wangora wanyɛ ye nwo hwee bɔ wamaa biaa he awu ne?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu sa guale nwomeɛ bieku ne, ɔwale asieleɛ naso. Né ɔte nyɔboɛ bɔ wayɛ kyɛ sua, na né bafa nyɔboɛ bakisa ye noa. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔye nyɔboɛ ne bɛfi berɛ.” Na Marta bɔ oliema brienzua awu ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, bekye de ɔbõ, ofikyɛ owuli ne, ɛlɛnna ɛhe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Manga mangyire wɔ kyɛ, sɛ enya gyidie a, ekonwu Nyameɛ anuonyam?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Yeti bɛyele nyɔboɛ ne bɛfili berɛ. Na Yesu mane ye ti so neane anwuro, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Baba, meda wase kyɛ atie me. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Mese kyɛ daa ɛtie me; nakoso mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ wa nati yeɛ me dwudwo ne, ná wamaa balɛ́ bali kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛsomane me ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Lazarus, fite bra!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ná sona bɔ wawu ne fite wale, né bafa ɛtena bakyekye ye gya ne sa, na né bafa ɛtena bie bakyekye ye nyunu. Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ sangye ye, ná ɛmɔma ɔhɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Yeti, Yudafoɛ bɔ ne bawa Mary berɛ ne nwuni bɔ wasi ne, na bɛ nu pee nyane gyidie wɔ ye nu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Nakoso ebiemɔ hɔle Farisifoɛ nemɔ berɛ, na bɛhane bɔ Yesu ayɛ ne bɛhyirele bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Yeti sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ frɛle Sanhendrin ne maa beyiale, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ yɛyɛ ɔ, biaa he yɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Sɛ yɛmaa ɔkɔso yɛ sɔ a, ebiala kole ye koli, ná Romanfoɛ nemɔ kɔwa kɔɔfa ɛwa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa ebie a “Nekaa bɔ yɛso ne, kyire kyɛ asɔre awuro ne.”</char></note> ne yɛ maen namu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Nakoso bɛ nu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kaiafa, bɔ sɔ afoɛ ne, né ɔte sɔfo panyine hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnze hwee, <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />ɛmɔnze kyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ sona-horɛ kowu kɔma maen, tra kyɛ bɛkɔsɛkye maen namu ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Nakoso nná ye ti anu adwene yeɛ ɔfa hane sɔ dwirɛ ne ɔ, mmom ɔnate kyɛ sɔ afoɛ ne, ye yeɛ ne ɔte sɔfo panyi nati, né ɔhyɛ ngɔm kyɛ odikyɛ Yesu wu ma maen ne. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Nná maen ne angome, na mmom okosa kɔboɔboa Nyameɛ mmaa bɔ babɔ bapete ne noa maa bɛkɔyɛ kõ. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ná ofi sɔ kyẽa ne, bɛbɔle porɛ kyɛ bɛkɔhu ye.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Yeti, Yesu anye ye nwo ali annate-nate Yudafoɛ nanu kõ, mmom ofili berɛ hɔle nekaa bɔ opingye ɛserɛ naso, kuro bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Efraim nu, na ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ tenane berɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yudafoɛ Pɛnu afahyɛ ne apingye, ná mmeni pee fili nguraa nemɔ nu fo hɔle Yerusalem kyɛ bɛkwaate bɛ nwo kora ne Pɛnu afahyɛ ne adwu so. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Né bɛpena Yesu, yeti mmerɛ bɔ bɛgyi asɔre awuro berɛ ne, né bɛ bisa-bisa bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ sɛ? Ɔngɔwa afahyɛ nabo koraa hɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Né sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ ahyɛ mmeraa kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okonwu nekaa bɔ Yesu wɔ ne, ɔɔha ma bɛhye ye.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Né waha ɛlɛsia maa bɛdi Pɛnu ne, na Yesu wale Betania, nekaa bɔ Lazarus bɔ otingyele ye fili awufo nu ne wɔ ne. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Nnɔsoa ne, bɛyɛle aleɛ bɛmane ye wɔ berɛ, Marta yeɛ ne ɔsõ bɛ ɔ, na né Lazarus boka bɛ bɔ bɛne ye didi naso. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Na Mary fale ngoo fona-fona bɔ ye nyɔboɛ yɛ se paa, ngoo pa bɔ bafa nardo bayɛ towaa kõ, ohwie guale Yesu gya nwo, na ɔfale ye ti nwiaa kyikyile. Ná ngoo ne pambaen ne lɛle awuro berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Nakoso asuafoɛ nanu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yuda Iskariot, bɔ ne ɔbaaye Yesu ma ne hane kyɛ: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Nzuati yeɛ bandɔne ngoo fona-fona he banne dɛnare 300 bamva bamma ahiafoɛ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ɔtte kyɛ Yuda dwene ahiafoɛ nwo ti yeɛ ɔhane sɔ ɔ, mmom ne ɔte awieniɛ. Ye yeɛ ne sikaa alaka ne wɔ ye berɛ ɔ, na ne owia sikaa bɔ bɛfa bɛgua nu ne. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔyakyi ye, ná ɔyɛ ɛhe ma kyẽa bɔ bɛkosie me ne. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ofikyɛ ahiafoɛ de, daa bɛne ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛwɔ wa ɔ, nakoso me de, ɛmɔngonya me daa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Na Yudafoɛ nanu pee nwuni kyɛ Yesu wɔ berɛ, yeti bɛwale berɛ. Nná Yesu ngome ti yeɛ bɛwale berɛ ɔ, mmom né bɛbaanea Lazarus bɔ watingye ye wafi ewue nu ne. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Yeti sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ bɔle porɛ kyɛ bekohu Lazarus koso, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ofikyɛ yeti yeɛ ne Yudafoɛ nanu pee kɔ berɛ, na bedɛ Yesu bɛdi ne.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Aleɛ hene ne, mmenia nwora bɔ bɛwale afahyɛ nabo ne tele kyɛ Yesu ba Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Yeti, bɛfale ɛberɛ kyɛ bɛkwaayia ye, na bɛbɔle ose kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“<char style="tl">Hozanna</char>!” <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hozanna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">te Hebri dwirɛ bɔ yebo kyire kyɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wɔ, de ye.” Greek nu ne, sɔa yeɛ bɛtworɔ ye ɔ: “ὡσαννά (hōsanná).” </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Nhyira yeɛ ole bɔ ɔba Awurade dumaa nu ne!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Nhyira yeɛ ole Israel Hene ne!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu nwuni afunum ba bie, na ɔtenane ye so kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne, bahworɔ kyɛ:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Zion awa brasua, nnɛsuro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Nea, wɔ hene ba wɔ berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">na ɔte afunum ba so.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ahyɛaseɛ ne, né asuafoɛ nemɔ nde sɔ nningyein nemɔ bo, nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ bɛhyɛle Yesu anuonyam ne, bɛkayele kyɛ, né bahworɔ sɔ nningyein he amukoraati bafa ye nwo, na bɛyɛ bɛmane ye. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Na mmenia nwora bɔ ne bɛwɔ berɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɔfrɛle Lazarus fili asieleɛ nanu, na otingyele ye fili ewue nu ne, bɛlili ye nwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Na ɔnate kyɛ mmeni lɔen ne tele kyɛ wayɛ sɔ nzɛngyerɛneɛ nemɔ nati yeɛ beeyiale ye ne. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Na né Farisifoɛ nemɔ keka kyɛ; “Nnaa ɛmɔ anwu ye kyɛ ɛmɔ ngɔhora ye nwo hwee yɛ. Ɛmɔnea, wiase mukoraati yeɛ bɛli ye si ne.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Bɛ bɔ bɛhɔle afahyɛ nabo kyɛ bɛkwaasõ ne, né Greekfoɛ biemɔ boka so. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ wale Filipo bɔ ofi Betsaida bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne berɛ, na bɛha behyirele ye kyɛ: “Owura, yɛpena kyɛ yɛnwu Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo bɔle Andrea amaneɛ, na Andrea ne Filipo wale Yesu berɛ bɛɛbɔle ye amaneɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mmerɛ aso kyɛ bɛhyɛ Sona Awa ne anuonyam. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ hwiit baa kõ andɔ ase anwu a, ɔtɛ́ te baa kõ; nakoso sɛ owu a, osu mmaa pee. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ebiala bɔ okuro ye ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> ne, okofi ye sa, nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔtane ye ngoa<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> wɔ wiase he anu ne, ɔkɔbɔ ye nwo waen kɔhɔ daa ngoa nu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ ɔsõ me a, odikyɛ odi me si; na nekaa bɔ nwɔ ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ me somvoɛ ne koso kɔwa ɔ. Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ ɔsõ me a, me Baba koso koli ye ni.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Afei de, me nwo teetee me.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Me kra nwo teetee ye.”</char></note> Na nzu po yeɛ nga ɔ? Baba, dɛ́ me fi mmerɛ he anu! Nakoso, ɛhe ati yeɛ mawa sɔ mmerɛ he anu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Baba, hyɛ wɔ dumaa anuonyam.” Yeɛ konviɛ bie fili anwuro hane kyɛ: “Mahyɛ ye anuonyam dada, na ngɔhyɛ ye anuonyam bieku.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Na mmeni lɔen bɔ bɛgyi berɛ ne tele, na bɛhane kyɛ agralaa abɔnu. Na ebiemɔ koso hane kyɛ: “Abɔfo adwudwo ahyire ye.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Nná me ti yeɛ konviɛ he wale ɔ, ɛmɔ ti yeɛ ɔwale ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Kesaalae, bɛbu wiase he atɛn; kesaalae, bɛbaaye bɔ odi wiase he aso ne bɛfi berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Na me de, sɛ benya bɛma me so bɛfi aseɛ naso a, ngɔhwe mmenia ahoroɛ mukoraati ngɔwa me nwo.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Né ɔka sɔ dwirɛ ne fa kyire ewue horɛ bɔ ɔbaawu ne. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Yeɛ mmenia ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yate ye wɔ Mmeraa nanu kyɛ, Kristo ne wɔ berɛ daa. Yeti, nzuati yeɛ ɛka kyɛ, odikyɛ bɛma Sona Awa naso ne? Sona Awa beni yeɛ ɛka ye nwo dwirɛ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Na Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Kanea ne kɔtena ɛmɔ nu mmerɛ kaa. Ɛmɔ nate mmerɛ bɔ kanea ne wɔ berɛ ne, ná awosii anni ɛmɔ so. Ebiala bɔ ɔnate awosii nu ne, ɔnze nekaa bɔ ɔkɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔle kanea ne, ɛmɔnya gyidie wɔ kanea nanu, na wamaa ɛmɔ ayɛ kanea ne mmaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu hane ɛhemɔ yiele ne, ofili berɛ, na ɔfale ye nwo feale bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ɔwɔ nu, ne wayɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee wahyire bɛ, nakoso banne ye banni, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, diifoɛ Isaiah dwirɛ ne kɔwa nu ɔ, ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Awurade, nwa yeɛ wale yɛ dwirɛ bɔ yɛhane ne wali ɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Na nwa yeɛ baye Awurade sa bahyire ye ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Bɔ yeti yeɛ banne banni ne, Isaiah sa hane kyɛ:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Wasi bɛ nye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na wamaa b'ahone ayɛ se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛngɔfa bɛ nye bɛngonwu nikye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ná bafa b'ahone bate yebo basakra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">maa masa bɛ anwonyerɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaiah hane sɔ nningyein hemɔ, ofikyɛ onwuni ye anuonyam, na ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ye mukoraati si ne, atumvoɛ nanu biemɔ po nyane gyidie wɔ ye nu, nakoso Farisifoɛ nati, bannye bɛ nyunu, sɛ bɛyɛle sɔ a, ahaa bɛkɔtu bɛ bɛkofi sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ofikyɛ, né bɛkuro sona anuonyam bɛtra Nyameɛ deɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Nakoso, Yesu teane nu hane kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ okole me koli ne, nná me ngome yeɛ wale me wali ɔ, mmom wale bɔ ɔsomane me ne koso wali; <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Na bɔ okonwu me ne, wanwu bɔ ɔsomane me ne koso. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mawa wiase kyɛ kanea, na ebiala bɔ odɛ́ me di ne, ɔngɔha awosii nu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Nakoso sɛ ebie te me dwirɛ, na wanni so a, memmu ye atɛn; ofikyɛ mamma kyɛ mebaabu wiase atɛn, mmale kyɛ mebaale wiase ne ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ebiala bɔ ɔpo me, na ɔnne me dwirɛ ndonu ne, ole bɔ ɔkɔbu ye atɛn ɔ. Edwirɛ bɔ maha ne, ɛhene yeɛ kyẽa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, okobu ye atɛn ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ofikyɛ, nná me bɔbɔ mepɛ yeɛ mefa medwudwo ɔ, mmom Baba bɔ ɔsomane me ne ahyire me bɔ nga, ne bɔ ngyire ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na mese kyɛ, ye ahyɛdeɛ ne te daa ngoa. Yeti bɔ ngɔha biala ne, bɔ Baba ne ahyire me nala yeɛ meka ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Né waha kaa maa bɛdi Pɛnu afahyɛ ne, na né Yesu se kyɛ ye mmerɛ aso kyɛ ofi wiase he anu, na ɔkɔ ye Baba dɔ. Na ɔnate kyɛ Yesu dɔ ye bɔbɔ ye deɛ bɔ bɛwɔ wiase nati, ɔlɔle bɛ oosili awieɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Na nnɔsoa bɔ bɛdidi ne, né Abɔnzam afa wura Simon awa Yuda Iskariot ahone nu dada kyɛ ɔye ye ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Ná ɔnate kyɛ ne Yesu se kyɛ ye Baba afa nikye biala awura ye sa, ná ofi Nyameɛ dɔ yeɛ ɔwale, na osa kɔ ye dɔ nati, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />odwɔso fili aleɛ nabo, na ɔfale atadeɛ bɔ ogua ye so ne guale berɛ. Yeɛ ɔfale nzasrɛ bɔle ye nu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Afei ɔfale nzue guale nikye nu, na ɔhyɛle yebo nwunzini asuafoɛ nemɔ gya bo, na ɔfale nzasrɛ bɔ ɔbɔ ye nu ne nunune bɛ gya nanwo. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Odwuli Simon Petro so ne, Petro bisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, wɔ yeɛ ɛnwunzi me gya bo ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bɔ meyɛ ne, kesaalae de, ɛngɔte ye bo, nakoso yesi ne, ɛkɔte ye bo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Yeɛ Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mengɔma ɛngɔnwunzi me gya bo lle.” Yesu koso ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ amma mannwunzi wɔ gya bo a, ye de ɛlle kyɛfa biala wɔ me nu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Yeɛ Simon Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nnɛnwunzi me gya bo ngome, nwunzi me sa nwo ne me ti so koso.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ wabia ne, ye nwo nhia kyɛ bɛbia ye kõ, ye gya bo ngome yeɛ odikyɛ onwunzi ɔ, ofikyɛ ye nwo mukoraati afi. Ɛmɔ nwo afi, nakoso nná ɛmɔ mu ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Né ɔse sona bɔ ɔbaaye ye ma ne, yeti yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Nná ɛmɔ mukoraati yeɛ ɛmɔ nwo afi ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Onwunzini bɛ gya bo yiele ne, ɔfale ye atadeɛ ne wurale, na osa tenane tɛbulu nanwo, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ mayɛ mama ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔte yebo? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Ɛmɔfrɛ me Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne Awurade, ye ala ne, ofikyɛ nde Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne Awurade. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Na sɛ me bɔ nde Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne Awurade ne, mawunzi ɛmɔ gya bo a, ye de ɛmɔ koso, odikyɛ ɛmɔ nu biala nwunzi ye mmango gya bo. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Na mayɛ nneasoɛ mama ɛmɔ, yeti bɔ mayɛ ne, ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔyɛ sɔ ala. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, akoaa ndra ye wura; na somafoɛ ndra bɔ ɔsomane ye ne. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Sɛ ɛmɔse ɛhemɔ na ɛmɔyɛ a, ne ɛmɔle anigye.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Edwirɛ bɔ meka ne, ɔmva ɛmɔ mukoraati nwo, mese bɛ bɔ maye bɛ ne; kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Tworɔnzɛm ne kɔwa nu kyɛ: ‘Sona bɔ odi m'aleɛ ne, ye yeɛ wadwɔso watia me ne.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Afei meka ɛhe mekyire ɛmɔ kora né wasi, na sɛ osi a, ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali kyɛ me yeɛ nne ye. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okole sona bɔ masoma ye ne, wale me, na ebiala bɔ okole me ne, wale Bɔ ɔsomane me ne koso.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu hane ɛhemɔ yiele ne, ne ye nwo teetee ye, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Nahorɛ nu, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔ nu kõ kɔye me kɔma.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Na asuafoɛ nemɔ hyɛle yebo neɛneane bɛ nwo nyunu, né bɛnnwu sona bɔ ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Suaniɛ bɔ Yesu kuro ye dwirɛ paa ne, né ɔte Yesu nwo berɛ pɛɛ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Né watena wakisa Yesu.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Yeti Simon Petro bɔle ye nye hyirele ye bisale ye kyɛ: “Ka kyire yɛ, nwa yeɛ ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Yeti, suaniɛ ne kisale Yesu hue so, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nwa ane?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Bɔ ngɔfa paanoo sii he ngɔbɔ kwangoa nanu ngɔma ye ne, ye ɛne.” Yeti Yesu fale paanoo ne bɔle kwangoa nanu, na ɔfa mane Simon Iskariot awa Yuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda lɛle paanoo sii nala pɛ, Satan wurale ye nu. Yeti, Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bɔ ɛyɛ ne, yɛ ye ndɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɛte tɛbulu nanwo ne, bɛ nu biala anwu bɔ yeti yeɛ Yesu hane sɔ dwirɛ ne hyirele ye ne. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ɔnate kyɛ Yuda yeɛ ne sikaa alaka ne wɔ ye berɛ nati, ne ebiemɔ adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ Yesu ka kyire ye kyɛ, “Kɔtotɔ nningyein bɔ yɛbaafa yɛdi afahyɛ ne,” anaakyɛ ɔfa nikye bie maa ahiafoɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yeti olɛle paanoo sii ne yiele ne, ɛberɛ ala yeɛ ofili berɛ hɔle ɔ, na ne aleɛ asa.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ofite hɔle ne, Yesu hane kyɛ, “Afei de, bahyɛ Sona Awa ne anuonyam, na ɔnate ye so, bahyɛ Nyameɛ koso anuonyam. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Nyameɛ bɔbɔ kɔhyɛ ye anuonyam, na ɔkɔhyɛ ye anuonyam ndɛ-ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Me mmaa mɔ, mene ɛmɔ kɔtena wa kaa. Ɛmɔ kɔpena me, nakoso ɛmɔ ngonwu me, na bɔ nga ngyirele Yudafoɛ nemɔ ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kesaalae ɔ, yeɛ ole kyɛ, ‘Nekaa bɔ mekɔ ne, ɛmɔ ngɔhora berɛ ba.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Mema ɛmɔ ahyɛdeɛ foforɛ, yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo. Kyɛbɔ medɔ ɛmɔ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Sɛ ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo a, ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ebiala konwu ye kyɛ, amba, ɛmɔte m'asuafoɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon Petro bisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nisua yeɛ ɛkɔ ne?” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nekaa bɔ mekɔ ne, kesaalae de, ɛngɔhora me si di, nakoso ye si ne, ekoli me si.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Yeɛ Petro hane kyɛ: “Awurade, nzuati yeɛ kesaalae de, mengɔhora wɔ si di ɔ? Me ngoa po a, ngɔfa ngɔto berɛ ngɔma wɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Ɛkɔfa wɔ ngoa kɔto berɛ kɔma me? Nahorɛ nu, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, kora bɔ akɔ kɔbɔ ne, né aha ye pɛn nza kyɛ ɛnze me.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Né aye me ama pɛn nza.”</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ wora bɔ. Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnya gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu, na ɛmɔnya gyidie koso wɔ me nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Nekaa pee wɔ me Baba awuro berɛ, sɛ ɔtte sɔ a, ahaa nzuati yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mekwaasiesie nekaa bie mema ɛmɔ ne? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na sɛ mekosiesie nekaa mema ɛmɔ a, ngosa ngɔwa, ná maafa ɛmɔ mahɔ me bɔbɔ me berɛ, ná nekaa bɔ nwɔ ne, ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ awa berɛ bie. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na nekaa bɔ mekɔ ne, ɛmɔse atee ne.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Yeɛ Tomas bisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, yɛnze nekaa bɔ ɛkɔ ne, ye de ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né yanwu atee ne?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne atee ne, nahorɛ ne, ne ngoa ne. Sɛ ebie kɔhora kɔwa Baba ne berɛ a, sana ɔfa me so. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Sɛ ɛmɔse me a, ye de, ɛmɔse me Baba ne koso. Ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, ɛmɔse ye, na ɛmɔ anwu ye.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, kyire yɛ Baba ne, na ɛhene ala yeɛ yɛhia ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Filipo, mmerɛ-tende bɔ mene ɛmɔ atena ne, enya nwuni me? Ebiala bɔ wanwu me ne, wanwu Baba ne. Na nzuati yeɛ ɛka kyɛ, ‘Kyire yɛ Baba ne’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Enne nni kyɛ nwɔ Baba ne nu, na Baba ne koso wɔ me nu? Edwirɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ne, nná me bɔbɔ me adwene yeɛ mefa meka ɔ. Mmom Baba ne bɔ ɔwɔ me nu ne, ye yeɛ ɔyɛ ye adwuma ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Ɛmɔle me bɛli, nwɔ Baba ne nu, na Baba ne koso wɔ me nu. Nná sɔ a, ɛmɔnea nningyein bɔ meyɛ ne, na ɛmɔle bɛli.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />“Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ onya gyidie wɔ me nu ne, ɔkɔyɛ adwuma bɔ meyɛ ne bie; na ɔkɔyɛ nyumaa mbiri-mbiri kɔtra bɔ meyɛ ne po, ofikyɛ mekɔ Baba ne dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Afei, nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔ kobisa ye wɔ me dumaa nu ne, ngɔyɛ, ná wamaa bahyɛ Baba ne anuonyam wɔ Baa ne nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Sɛ ɛmɔ bisa nikye biala wɔ me dumaa nu a, ngɔyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Sɛ ɛmɔdɔ me a, ɛmɔ koli m'ahyɛdeɛ so. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Na ngɔsrɛ Baba ne maa ɔkɔma ɛmɔ bokafoɛ foforɛ bɔ ɔne ɛmɔ kɔtena daa. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ye yeɛ ole nahorɛ honhom bɔ wiase ne ngora nnya ye ne, ofikyɛ wiase ne nwuni ye, na bɛnze ye. Ɛmɔ de ɛmɔse ye, ofikyɛ ɔne ɛmɔ yeɛ bɛte ɔ, na ɔte ɛmɔ nu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Mengɔyakyi ɛmɔ kyɛ nyisiaa, ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Waha kaa bie né wiase nnwu me kõ, nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ konwu me; ofikyɛ nde ase, na ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ kɔtena ase. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Sɔ kyẽa ne, ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ, nwɔ me Baba ne nu, na ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ wɔ me nu, na me koso nwɔ ɛmɔ nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Ebiala bɔ otie m'ahyɛdeɛ na odi so ne, ye yeɛ ɔdɔ me ɔ. Na bɔ ɔdɔ me ne, me Baba koso kɔlɔ ye, na me koso ngɔlɔ ye, na ngɔla me nwo ali ngohyire ye.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Afei Yuda (nná Iskariot ne ɔ) bisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nzuati yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ ɛye wɔ nwo ali pefee kyire yɛ, na ɛngɔye ngohyire wiase ne?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu yele yenoa kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie dɔ me a, okoli me dwirɛ so, na me Baba kɔlɔ ye, na yɛkɔwa ye berɛ, na yaatena ye nu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yaafa ye berɛ yayɛ y'awuro.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ebiala bɔ ɔnnɔ me ne, onni me dwirɛ so. Edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔte ne, ɔtte me deɛ, mmom ɔte Baba bɔ ɔsomane me ne deɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Maha edwirɛ he mahyire ɛmɔ, mmerɛ bɔ mene ɛmɔ wɔ wa ne. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Nakoso honhom krongron, bokafoɛ bɔ Baba ne kɔsoma ye me dumaa nu ne, ye yeɛ okohyirehyire ɛmɔ nikye biala, na ɔkɔkaye-kaye ɛmɔ nningyein bɔ maha mahyire ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Asomdwie yeɛ mefa meyakyi ɛmɔ ɔ; mefa m'asomdwie mema ɛmɔ. Nná kyɛbɔ wiase fa asomdwie ma ne yeɛ mefa mema ɛmɔ ɔ. Nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ wora bɔ, na nnɛmɔ maa esuronyi ka ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Nnaa ɛmɔ tele kyɛ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Mekɔ, na ngosa ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ.’ Sɛ ɛmɔdɔ me a, ɔkɔyɛ ɛmɔ fɛ kyɛ mesa mekɔ me Baba ne berɛ, ofikyɛ Baba ne te piri tra me. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ná mali moa maha mahyire ɛmɔ kora yeɛ ɔbaasi ɔ, na sɛ osi a, ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Mene ɛmɔ ngodwudwo pee, ofikyɛ bɔ odi wiase naso ne ba, ná olle me so tumi. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Na bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na wiase ne anwu kyɛ medɔ Baba nati, ahyɛdeɛ bɔ Baba ne afa ama me ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ meyɛ ɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Ɛmɔ dwɔso, na ɛmɔma yefi wa yɛhɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Me yeɛ nne nahorɛ bobe ne, na me Baba yeɛ ole kuaniɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Asaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmaen.”</char></note> biala bɔ ɔwɔ me nwo, bɔ onzu mmaa ne, ɔpɛ to; na asaa biala bɔ osu mmaa ne de, ɔyeye ye nwo, ná wamaa wasu mmaa pee. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Edwirɛ bɔ maha mahyire ɛmɔ nati, ɛmɔ nwo ate dada. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ɛmɔtena me nu, ná me koso ngɔtena ɛmɔ nu. Kyɛbɔ asaa ne bɔbɔ ngora nzu mmaa, sana otua bobe ne nwo ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ ngɔhora bɛngɔsu mmaa, sana ɛmɔ tena me nu. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Me yeɛ nde bobe ne, na ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔte asaa ne. Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔtena me nu, na me koso ngɔtena ye nu ne, ye yeɛ osu mmaa pee ɔ; ofikyɛ nne nu a, ɛmɔ ngɔhora hwee yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Sɛ ebie andena me nu a, bɛpɛ ye bɛto te kyɛ bakaa ne sa ne maa owu. Na mmenia sesa sɔ asaa nemɔ, na begyi bɛgua see nu maa ɔyera. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Sɛ ɛmɔtena me nu, na me dwirɛ ne tena ɛmɔ nu a, ɛmɔ bisa bɔ ɛmɔ kuro biala, na ɛmɔ sa kɔha ye. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Bɔ ɔhyɛ me Baba anuonyam yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔ kosu mmaa pee, na ɛmɔ ahyire kyɛ ɛmɔte m'asuafoɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Kyɛbɔ Baba ne dɔ me ne, sɔ ala yeɛ medɔ ɛmɔ ɔ; ɛmɔhɔ so bɛtena medɔ nu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Sɛ ɛmɔdi m'ahyɛdeɛ so a, ɛmɔ kɔtena medɔ nu, kyɛbɔ mali Baba ne ahyɛdeɛ so, na nde ye dɔ nu ne. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Maha ɛhemɔ mahyire ɛmɔ, na wamaa ɛmɔ anya m'anigye ne bie, na ɛmɔ anigye ne ali mu.<verse eid="JHN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />“Me ahyɛdeɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo kyɛbɔ medɔ ɛmɔ nala. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ole ɔdɔ bɔ ɔtra ɛhe ɔ, kyɛ ebie kɔfa ye ngoa kɔto berɛ kɔma ye nnamvo mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Sɛ ɛmɔdi ahyɛdeɛ bɔ mafa mema ɛmɔ naso a, né ɛmɔte me nnamvo. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Mengɔfrɛ ɛmɔ ngoaa kõ, ofikyɛ akoaa nze bɔ ye wura yɛ ɔ; mmom mefrɛ ɛmɔ nnamvo, ofikyɛ bɔ mate mafi me Baba berɛ biala, mamaa ɛmɔ anwu ye. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nná ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ yele me ɔ, me mmom yeɛ nyele ɛmɔ ɔ. Na nyele ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔɔsu mmaa, ná ɛmɔ mmaa ne tena berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔ kobisa Baba ne wɔ me dumaa nu ne, ɔkɔfa kɔma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ahyɛdeɛ hemɔ yeɛ mefa mema ɛmɔ ɔ, na wamaa ɛmɔ adodɔ ɛmɔ nwo.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Sɛ wiase tane ɛmɔ a, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ wali moa watane me kora yeɛ ɔbaatane ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Sɛ ɛmɔboka wiase naso a, ahaa wiase ne kohuro bɔ ɔte ye deɛ ne dwirɛ. Nakoso ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔ bokka wiase naso, na maye ɛmɔ mafi wiase nati, wiase ne tane ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Ɛmɔkaye edwirɛ bɔ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ ne: ‘Akoaa ndra ye wura.’ Sɛ né bɛtane me nye a, ɛmɔ koso bɛkɔtane ɛmɔ nye; sɛ bɛlili me dwirɛ so a, bɛkoli ɛmɔ deɛ so. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Na me dumaa ti, bɛkɔfa ɛhe amukoraati bɛkɔyɛ ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ bɛnze bɔ ɔsomane me ne. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Sɛ mamma andwudwo angyire bɛ a, ahaa benni bɔne nwo fɔ. Nakoso kesaalae de, bɛlle hwee bɔ bɛfa bɛye bɛ nwo noa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Ebiala bɔ ɔtane me ne, ɔtane me Baba koso. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Sɛ manyɛ nyumaa bɔ ebiala yɛlle bie lle wɔ bɛ nu a, ahaa benni bɔne nwo fɔ; na afei de, banwu me, nakoso bɛtane me ne me Baba. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Na ɛhe ama edwirɛ bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ bɛ Mmeraa ne anu ne awa nu kyɛ: ‘Bɛ tane me mbaen.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Bokafoɛ bɔ ngɔsoma ye ngofi Baba ne dɔ ne, nahorɛ honhom bɔ ofi Baba ne berɛ ne, sɛ ɔba a, ye yeɛ okoli me nwo adanzeɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Na ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ koli adanzeɛ, ofikyɛ ofi ahyɛaseɛ ne, mene ɛmɔ yeɛ yɛwɔ berɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Maha ɛhemɔ mahyire ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a nikye fee ngɔto ɛmɔ sintidua. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bɛkɔtu ɛmɔ bɛkofi sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. Nahorɛ nu, mmerɛ bie ba, bɔ ebiala bɔ okohu ɛmɔ ne, okonya adwene kyɛ ɔyɛ sɔ fa so Nyameɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bɛkɔyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ, ofikyɛ bennya bɛnwuni Baba ne, anaa me. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Maha ɛhemɔ mahyire ɛmɔ, na mmerɛ ne so a, ɛmɔ akaye kyɛ, nga ngyirele ɛmɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Ahyɛaseɛ ne de, manga ɛhe mangyire ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ né mene ɛmɔ yeɛ yɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nakoso kesaalae de, mekɔ bɔ ɔsomane me ne berɛ, nakoso ɛmɔ nu biala bisalle me kyɛ, ‘Nisua yeɛ ɛkɔ ɔ?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Na ɔnate kyɛ maha ɛhemɔ mahyire ɛmɔ nati, wamaa ɛmɔ wora abɔ paa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Nakoso, nahorɛ yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔ pa nu ti yeɛ mekɔ ne. Sɛ mangɔ a, bokafoɛ ne ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ. Nakoso sɛ mekɔ a, ngɔsoma ye maa ɔkɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Na sɛ ɔba a, ɔkɔma wiase ne adanzeɛ bɔ ɔfa bɔne, tenenee, ne atemmuo nwo. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ɔfa bɔne nwo, ofikyɛ belle gyidie wɔ me nu; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />afei ɔfa tenenee nwo, ofikyɛ mekɔ Baba ne dɔ, na ɛmɔ ngonwu me kõ; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />yeɛ ɔfa atemmuo nwo, ofikyɛ babu bɔ odi wiase he aso ne atɛn.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nne edwirɛ pee bɔ odikyɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ɔ, nakoso kesaalae de, ɛmɔ ngɔhora ye soa. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Nakoso, sɛ nahorɛ honhom ne ba a, okohyire ɛmɔ atee kɔhɔ nahorɛ namukoraati nu. Ofikyɛ nná ye bɔbɔ ye pɛ yeɛ ɔkɔfa kodwudwo ɔ, mmom bɔ ɔkɔte ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔha ɔ, na ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu nningyein bɔ ɔbaasisi ne. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ye yeɛ ɔkɔhyɛ me anuonyam ɔ, ofikyɛ ɔkɔfa me deɛ ne bie, ná waha wahyire ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Bɔ Baba ne le ye biala te me deɛ, ɛhene ati yeɛ ngane kyɛ, me deɛ ne bie yeɛ ɔkɔha kohyire ɛmɔ ne.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Waha kaa bie, né ɛmɔnnwu me kõ, nakoso waha kaa bie, ɛmɔ kosa bɛkonwu me.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ɛhe ati, asuafoɛ nemɔ bie bisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Waha kaa bie, né ɛmɔnnwu me kõ, nakoso waha kaa bie, ɛmɔ kosa bɛkonwu me,’ ná osa hane kyɛ, ‘ofikyɛ mekɔ Baba ne dɔ’ ne, né ɔpena kyire sɛɛ”? <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Yeti ne bɛka kyɛ: “‘Waha kaa bie’ bɔ ɔhane ne, né ɔpena kyire sɛɛ? Yɛnde bɔ ɔka ne bo po.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Né Yesu se kyɛ, bɛpena kyɛ bɛ bisa ye dwirɛ, yeti ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔnate kyɛ ngane kyɛ ‘Waha kaa bie, né ɛmɔnnwu me kõ, nakoso waha kaa bie, ɛmɔ kosa bɛkonwu me’ ne, yeti yeɛ ɛmɔ bisa-bisa ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ ne anaa? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ: Ɛmɔ kosu bɛkɔpɛ awuye, nakoso wiase ne de, bɛ nye kɔgye; ɛmɔ koli aworaborɛ, nakoso ɛmɔ aworaborɛ ne kɔkakyi anigye. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Sɛ aworɛ ka brasua a, ɔte yealɛ, ofikyɛ ye mmerɛ aso, nakoso sɛ onya wo akwalaa ne a, ɔngaye yealɛ ne kõ, ofikyɛ ye nye agye kyɛ wawo sona wawa wiase ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Yeti ɛmɔ koso, kesaalae, ɛmɔ wora abɔ; nakoso ngonwu ɛmɔ bieku maa ɛmɔ ahone kɔtɔ ɛmɔ kunu; ná ɛmɔ anigye ne, ebiala ngole ngofi ɛmɔ sa nu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Na sɔ kyẽa ne, ɛmɔ ngobisa me hwee. Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔ kobisa Baba ne wɔ me dumaa nu ne, ɔkɔfa kɔma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ná ɔbadwu bekye, ɛmɔ bisalle nikye fee wɔ me dumaa nu. Nakoso ɛmɔ bisa, na ɛmɔ sa kɔha ye, ná wamaa ɛmɔ anigye ne ali mu.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Anyandera<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mvandoho.”</char></note> yeɛ mva ngane edwirɛ he ngyirele ɛmɔ ɔ. Mmerɛ bie ba, bɔ mengɔfa anyandera mengɔha hwee mengohyire ɛmɔ, mmom ngɔha Baba ne nwo dwirɛ ngohyire ɛmɔ pen. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Sɔ kyẽa ne, ɛmɔ kɔsrɛ Baba ne wɔ me dumaa nu; bɔ meka ne ngyire kyɛ me yeɛ ngɔsrɛ ngɔma ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Bɔ yeti yeɛ ɔte sɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, Baba ne bɔbɔ kuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ kuro me dwirɛ, na ɛmɔdɛ bɛdi kyɛ mvi Nyameɛ berɛ yeɛ mmale ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Baba ne berɛ yeɛ mvi mmale wiase ɔ. Na afei de, mefi wiase mekɔ Baba ne dɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ye asuafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Aha a, afei de, edwudwo pen-pen, ɛmmu anyandera kõ. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Afei de, yanwu kyɛ ɛse nningyein mukoraati, na ye nwo nhia kyɛ ebie kobisa wɔ dwirɛ. Ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ efi Nyameɛ berɛ yeɛ ɛwale ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Afei de ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ɛmɔnea, mmerɛ bie ba, na wawa po yeɛ ole sɔ, sɔ mmerɛ ne, ɛmɔ kɔbɔ kɔsande, na ebiala kɔhɔ ye awuro maa ɔkɔha me ngome. Nakoso ɔhalle me ngome, Baba ne boka me so. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Maha ɛhe mahyire ɛmɔ, na wamaa ɛmɔ anya asomdwie wɔ me nu. Ɛmɔ konwu amaneɛ paa wɔ wiase nanu de, nakoso ɛmɔnya akukuduro! Mali wiase naso ngunim.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu hane edwirɛ hemɔ yiele ne, ɔmane ye ti so neane anwuro, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Baba, mmerɛ ne aso. Hyɛ ɛwa ne anuonyam, ná wamaa ɛwa ne koso ahyɛ wɔ anuonyam, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />ofikyɛ ama ye tumi wɔ mmenia mukoraati so, kyɛ ɔma bɛ bɔ afa bɛ ama ye namukoraati daa ngoa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Sɛ ebie konya daa ngoa a, sana onwu wɔ bɔ ɛte nahorɛ Nyameɛ komapɛ ne, na onwu Yesu Kristo bɔ ɛsomane ye ne koso. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Mahyɛ wɔ anuonyam wɔ aseɛ he aso, na mayie adwuma bɔ ɛfa wurale me sa ne. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Yeti Baba, anuonyam bɔ ne nne ye wɔ wɔ berɛ kora yeɛ bɛbɔ wiase ne, fa sɔ anuonyam ne ma me wɔ wɔ berɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Mmenia bɔ ɛyele bɛ fili wiase mane me ne, mamaa banwu wɔ dumaa. Né bɛte wɔ deɛ yeɛ ɛfale bɛ mane me ɔ, na bali wɔ dwirɛ so. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kesaalae de banwu kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ afa ama me ne, sãa ofi wɔ berɛ; <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />ofikyɛ edwirɛ bɔ ɛfa mane me ne, mafa mama bɛ, na balɛ́ bato nu, na banwu ye kyɛ, amba mvi wɔ berɛ yeɛ mmale<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmale kyɛ mebaasi wɔ gya nu.”</char></note> ɔ; na balɛ́ bali kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛsomane me ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Na mesrɛ mema bɛ, menzrɛ memma wiase ne, mesrɛ mema bɛ bɔ ɛfale bɛ mane me ne, ofikyɛ bɛte wɔ deɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Nikye biala bɔ nne ye ne te wɔ deɛ, na wɔ deɛ koso te me deɛ, na manya anuonyam wɔ bɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Me de, nne wiase kõ, nakoso bɛ de, bɛwɔ wiase, na meba wɔ berɛ. Baba bɔ ɛte Krongron, wɔ dumaa bɔ afa ama me nati, nea bɛ so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔyɛ kõ, kyɛbɔ yɛte kõ ne. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Mmerɛ bɔ mene bɛ wɔ berɛ ne, wɔ bɔbɔ wɔ dumaa bɔ afa ama me nati, nneane bɛ so; na mmɔle bɛ nwo waen, yeti bɛ nu komapɛ po anzɛkye, sana bɔ ne ɔkɔsɛkye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Baa Sɛkyefoɛ.”</char></note> ne, ná ɔmaa tworɔnzɛm ne wale nu. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Kesaalae de meba wɔ berɛ, na meka sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ wɔ wiase nanu, ná wamaa m'anigye ali mu wɔ bɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mafa wɔ dwirɛ mama bɛ, nakoso wiase ne kyi bɛ, ofikyɛ bɛ bokka wiase naso, kyɛbɔ me koso mmoka wiase naso ne. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nná bɔ mesrɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ye bɛ fi wiase, mmom ɔbɔnefoɛ nati, mesrɛ wɔ, bɔ bɛ nwo waen.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mesrɛ wɔ, bɔ bɛ nwo waen fi ɔbɔnefoɛ nanwo.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Bɛ bokka wiase naso, kyɛbɔ me koso mmoka wiase naso ne. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Fa nahorɛ ne te bɛ nwo; wɔ dwirɛ ne te nahorɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kyɛbɔ ɛsomane me wale wiase ne, sɔ ala yeɛ me koso mesoma bɛ wɔ wiase ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Meyɛ me nwo krongron<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mete me nwo.”</char></note> mema bɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a nahorɛ ne kɔmaa bɛkɔyɛ krongron.<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛ nwo kɔte.”</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Menzrɛ memma bɛ ngome, mmom mesrɛ mema bɛ bɔ ɔnate bɛ dwirɛ naso, bɛkole me bɛkoli ne koso, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />né wamaa bɛ mukoraati bayɛ kõ, kyɛbɔ Baba, ɛwɔ me nu, na me koso nwɔ wɔ nu ne, ná bɛ koso bɛne yɛ ayɛ kõ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a wiase ne kole koli kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛsomane me ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Anuonyam bɔ ɛfa mane me ne, mafa mama bɛ, na wamaa bayɛ kõ, kyɛbɔ yɛte kõ ne. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nwɔ bɛ nu, na wɔ koso ɛwɔ me nu, ná wamaa bɛ koso bayɛ kõ paa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a wiase ne konwu kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛsomane me ɔ, na kyɛbɔ ɛdɔ me ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛdɔ bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Baba, bɛ bɔ afa bɛ ama me ne, mepena kyɛ bɛba boka me so wɔ nekaa bɔ nwɔ ne, né wamaa banwu anuonyam bɔ afa ama me ne, ofikyɛ ne ɛdɔ me kora yeɛ bɛhyɛ wiase bo ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />“Tenenee Baba, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ wiase ne nze wɔ, nakoso me de, mese wɔ, na ɛhemɔ anwu ye kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛsomane me ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mamaa banwu wɔ dumaa, na ngɔhɔ so ngɔmaa bɛkonwu ye, ná wamaa ɔdɔ bɔ ɛle ye ma me né atena bɛ nu, na me koso matena bɛ nu.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mene bɛ ayɛ kõ.”</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu hane edwirɛ hemɔ yiele ne, ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fitele, na bɛɛfale Kidron Bɔnza nanu bɛhɔle nekaa bɔ turo ne wɔ ne, na bɛhɔle turo nanu. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Né Yuda bɔ ɔkɔye ye kɔma ne koso se berɛ, ofikyɛ né Yesu taa ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ yianu berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yeti, Yuda fale sogyafoɛ pee ne asomvoɛ bɔ bɛfi sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ berɛ wale nekaa bɔ bɛwɔ ne, ne bɛtire-tira tɛen, kanea, ne akodeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu de, né ɔse bɔ ɔkɔto ye biala, yeti, ɔwale bɛ nyunu berɛ, yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɛmɔpena ye ne?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yesu, Nazerɛtniɛ ne.” Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me ɛhe.” Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yuda bɔ ɔbaaye ye ma ne koso gyi berɛ bie. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu hane kyɛ, “Me ɛhe” ne, bɛhɔle bɛ si, na bɛte bɛguale. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yeti osa bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔpena nwa?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yesu, Nazerɛtniɛ ne.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Maha mahyire ɛmɔ kyɛ me ane. Yeti sɛ me yeɛ ɛmɔpena me a, ɛmɔma ɛhemɔ hɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ɛhe maa edwirɛ bɔ ɔhane ne wale nu kyɛ: “Bɛ bɔ ɛfale bɛ mane me ne, mamma bɛ nu komapɛ po ammini.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Né Simon Petro le dadeɛ wura ye nwo, yeti ɔhwene, na ɔfa pɛle sɔfo panyi ne akoaa ne so famaa tole. Né akoaa ne dumaa li Malkus.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Malko.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele Petro kyɛ: “Fa wɔ dadeɛ ne wura ye bɔha nanu. Kwangoa bɔ Baba ne afa me ne, nnɛmaa meno anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Yeɛ sogyafoɛ nemɔ, bɛ sahene ne, ɔne Yudafoɛ polisifoɛ nemɔ hyele Yesu, na bɛkyekyele ye. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bɛli moa bɛfale ye bɛhɔle Annas berɛ, ofikyɛ né ye sia yeɛ ole Kaiafa bɔ sɔ afoɛ ne, né ɔte sɔfo panyi ne. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kaiafa yeɛ otule Yudafoɛ nemɔ fo kyɛ, ɔte pa kyɛ sona kõ kowu kɔma maen ne.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Né Simon Petro ne asuafoɛ nanu kõ li Yesu si. Sɔ suaniɛ ne de, né sɔfo panyi ne se ye, yeti olili Yesu si hɔle sɔfo panyi ne aluo berɛ, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />nakoso, né Petro gyi anoa ne si dɔ. Yeti suaniɛ bɔ sɔfo panyi ne se ye ne hɔle sona bɔ ogyi anoa nanwo ne berɛ, na ɔne ye dwudwole maa Petro wale nu. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Yeɛ afaneɛ bɔ ogyi anoa nanwo ne bisale Petro kyɛ: “Wɔ koso, nnaa ɛboka sɔ bia he asuafoɛ naso?” Nakoso ɔhane kyɛ: “Mmmoka so.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Né ayirɛ wɔ nu paa, yeti ne asomvoɛ ne né sogyafoɛ nemɔ afa ɛbunaen asɔ see, bɔ bɛto. Na ne Petro koso gyi berɛ ɔto see ne bie.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Na sɔfo panyi ne bisale Yesu ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ne ye ngyerɛkyerɛ nanwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Né medwudwo mekyire wiase ne wɔ badwanu. Né metaa mekyirekyire wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, ɔne sua bɔ Yudafoɛ yia nu nanu, manga hwee mvealeɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ye de, nzuati yeɛ ebisa me ɔ? Bisa bɛ bɔ bɛtele bɔ ngane ne. Nea, ɛhemɔ se bɔ ngane ne.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu noa pene nala pɛ, sogyaniɛ bɔ ogyi ye nwo berɛ ne bɔle ye nye so, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɔfo panyi yeɛ edwudwo kyire ye sɔ ne?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Sɛ ngane edwirɛ tɛɛ bie a, ka ma ebiala te, nakoso sɛ bɔ ngane ne te nahorɛ a, nzuati yeɛ abɔ me ne?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Yeti, Annas maa bɛkyekyele ye, na bɛfale ye bɛhɔle sɔfo panyi Kaiafa berɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Né Simon Petro gyi berɛ ɔto see, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ koso, nnaa ɛboka ye asuafoɛ naso?” Na ɔsale ye wɔ berɛ kyɛ: “Daabi! Mmmoka so!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Sɔfo panyi ne akoaa bɔ ye nwo niɛ yeɛ ole abrandeɛ bɔ Petro pɛle ye so ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Nwuni kyɛ né ɛboka ye so wɔ turo nanu dɔ, melaka?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Nakoso, Petro sa hane ye bieku kyɛ, ɔtte nahorɛ, na ɛberɛ ala, akɔ bɔle.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Na ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu ne, bɛfale Yesu bɛfili Kaiafa berɛ bɛhɔle Amrado né awuro berɛ. Nakoso bɛ bɔbɔ de, banwura awuro berɛ bie, ne bɛmbena kyɛ bɛ nwo gua fiɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔhora bɛkoli Pɛnu ne bie. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Yeti Pilato fite wale berɛ, na obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Kwaadu beni yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛbɔ sɔ biaa he ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ biaa he yɛlle bɔne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔtte ɔbɔnefoɛ.”</char></note> a, ahaa yɛngɔfa ye yɛngɔwa wɔ wa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Yeti Pilato ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔfa ye bɛhɔ, ná ɛmɔgyina ɛmɔ mmeraa naso bɛbu ye atɛn.” Yudafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Yɛ de, mmeraa mma yɛ atee kyɛ yɛhu ebie.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Né ɛhe kɔmaa ewue horɛ bɔ Yesu hane kyɛ ɔbaawu ne kɔwa nu.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Yeti Pilato sa wurale sua nanu, na ɔfrɛle Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ele Yudafoɛ hene ne?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu koso bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ ɛka ɔ, anaa ebiemɔ yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele wɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato yele ye noa kyɛ: “Nnaa nnde Yudaniɛ? Wɔ bɔbɔ wɔ mmenia ne, ɔne sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ yeɛ bɛfale wɔ bɛbrɛle me ɔ. Nzu yeɛ ayɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “M'Ahennie ne, offi wiase. Sɛ m'Ahennie ne fi wiase a, ahaa m'asomvoɛ kɔhõ, ná ahaa bɛngɔpene maa bɛngɔfa me bɛngɔma Yudafoɛ nemɔ. Nakoso kyɛbɔ ɔte ne, m'Ahennie ne, offi wiase.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Yeti, Pilato ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ye de, nnaa ɛte ɔhene?” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ ɛka kyɛ nde ɛhene ɔ. Me de, ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛwole me ɔ, na ɛhe ati yeɛ mmale wiase ɔ, kyɛ mebaali nahorɛ ne nwo adanzeɛ. Na ebiala bɔ ɔta nahorɛ ne si ne tie me dwirɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ole nahorɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, osa hɔle aluo dɔ, na ɔha hyirele Yudafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Mennwu mvomsoɛ biala wɔ ye nwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Nakoso ɛmɔle amammerɛ bie kyɛ, sɛ bɛdi Pɛnu biala a, odikyɛ meyakyi sona kõ mema ɛmɔ. Yeti ɛmɔpena kyɛ meyakyi Yudafoɛ hene ne mema ɛmɔ anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Na besa bɛteɛteane nu bieku kyɛ: “Yɛnguro ɛhe, yɛkuro Barabas!” Né Barabas te awieniɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Afei Pilato maa bɛgwale Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Na sogyafoɛ nemɔ fale mmowie yɛle abotire, na bɛfa bɛwurale ye ti, yeɛ bɛfale atadeɛ bɔ ye kɔla te <char style="tl">valent</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Purple” (Brɔfo)</char></note> bɛwurale ye. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Na bɛwale ye nwo berɛ bɛɛhane kyɛ: “Yudafoɛ hene, wɔ ngoa so oo!” Na bɛbobɔle ye nye so. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato sa hɔle aluo dɔ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea! Mefa ye mebrɛ ɛmɔ, ne wamaa ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ, menwu mvomsoɛ biala wɔ ye nwo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yeti Yesu fitele, né owura mmowie abotire ne, ɔne atadeɛ <char style="tl">valent</char> ne. Yeɛ Pilato hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea! Brienzua ne ɛhe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ sɔfo mbanyi ne asomvoɛ nemɔ nwuni ye, bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu! Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!” Pilato hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔɔbɔ ye asɛnnua nu, ofikyɛ me de, mennwu mvomsoɛ biala wɔ ye nwo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Yudafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Yɛle mmeraa, na ɛnea yɛ mmeraa nanu a, ɔfata ewue, ofikyɛ wayɛ ye nwo kyɛ ɔte Nyameɛ awa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Mmerɛ bɔ Pilato tele bɔ bɛka ne, esuronyi hane ye paa, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Yeti owurale sua nanu bieku, na obisale Yesu kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ efi ɔ?” Nakoso Yesu amma ye mmuayɛ biala. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Yeti Pilato hane kyɛ: “Ɛngɔtɛ me so? Ɛnze kyɛ nne tumi kyɛ meyakyi wɔ, na nne tumi kyɛ me maa bɛbɔ wɔ asɛnnua nu?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Sɛ bamva bamvi anwuro bamma wɔ a, ahaa ɛngonya tumi biala wɔ me so. Yeti yeɛ bɔ ɔyele me mane wɔ ne, ye bɔne te piri paa ne.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Ɛhe ati, né Pilato pena kyɛ ɔfa atee bie so yakyi ye, nakoso Yudafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛyakyi biaa he a, né Kaesare tte wɔ damvo. Ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ ye nwo kyɛ ɔte ɔhene ne, né odwɔso tia Kaesare.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Mmerɛ bɔ Pilato tele sɔ ne, ɔfale Yesu fitele, na ɔtenane atemmuo bia sɔ wɔ nekaa bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ Nyɔboɛ Pato ne, Hebri nu de, bɛfrɛ berɛ <char style="tl">Gabata</char>. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Né sɔ kyẽa ne te Pɛnu né Anwoboaboa kyẽa, na né wabɔ kɔyɛ eyia 12:00.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">12:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia.</char></note> Na Pilato ha hyirele Yudafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea, ɛmɔ Hene ne ɛhe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Nakoso bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Fa ye kɔ! Fa ye kɔ! Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!” Pilato bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Mmɔ ɛmɔ hene ne asɛnnua nu?” Sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ɔhene bɔ yele ye ala yeɛ ole Kaesare!” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Na ɔfale ye mane bɛ kyɛ bɛɛbɔ ye asɛnnua nu. Yeti bɛfale Yesu bɛhɔle. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Na ɔsoale ye asɛnnua ne fili berɛ hɔle nekaa bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ “Tire Kokuroka” ne; Hebri nu ne, bɛfrɛ ɛberɛ <char style="tl">Golgota</char>. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛbɔle Yesu ne mmrienzua nyɔ bie asɛnnua nu ne. Né kõ wɔ ye bɛen, yeɛ ne kõ wɔ ye famaa, na né Yesu wɔ bɛ afia. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato hworɔle edwirɛ bie bɔle asɛnnua ne tiafia kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="JHN 19:19">“NAZERƐTNIƐ YESU,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="JHN 19:19">YUDAFOƐ HENE NE.”<verse eid="JHN 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yudafoɛ pee kengale sɔ dwirɛ ne, ofikyɛ nekaa bɔ bɛbɔle Yesu asɛnnua nu ne, né opingye kuro ne, na bɛhworɔle ye wɔ Hebri, Latin ne Greek nu. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Nakoso Yudafoɛ sɔfo mbanyi ne ha hyirele Pilato kyɛ: “Nnɛtworɔ ye kyɛ ‘Yudafoɛ Hene ne,’ mmom ‘Ne ɔka kyɛ, Nde Yudafoɛ Hene.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ mahworɔ ala yeɛ mahworɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Sogyafoɛ nemɔ bɔle Yesu asɛnnua nu bɛyiele ne, bɛfale ye atadeɛ bɔ ɔfa gua ye so ne, na bɛhyɛle nu nná maa ebiala fale kõ. Na besa bɛfale ye atadeɛ bɔ owura yebo ne, nakoso ɛhene de, né banwo ye mukoraati bafi anwuro baadwu ase, na nekafee nne berɛ bɔ ne bapa ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Yeti, bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ maa yɛtete nu, mmom ɛmɔma yɛtɔɔso<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛbɔ ndondo.”</char></note> na yɛnea bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ye deɛ ɔ.” Ɛhe maa tworɔnzɛm ne wale nu kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bɛhyɛle me tena ne bɛfale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">na m'atadeɛ ne koso, bɛbɔle so ndondo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Sogyafoɛ nemɔ yeɛ bɛyɛle sɔ ne.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Né Yesu maame, ye maame aliema brasua, Klopa aye Mary, ne Mary Magdalene gyi asɛnnua ne bo berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ Yesu nwuni ye maame ne suaniɛ bɔ okuro ye dwirɛ ne kyɛ bɛgyi berɛ ne, ɔha hyirele ye maame kyɛ: “Maame, nea, ɛwa brienzua ɛhe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele suaniɛ ne kyɛ: “Nea, wɔ maame ɛhe!” Na ofi sɔ mmerɛ ne, suaniɛ ne fale ye hɔle ye awuro.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, mmerɛ bɔ Yesu nwuni kyɛ nikye biala awa awieɛ ne, bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ne tworɔnzɛm ne awa nu ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Nzuhɔen ku me.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ne bua bie gyi berɛ, na ne nzãa bɔ enu ka ayi ye dɛen. Yeti, bɛfale eminaen bɛbɔle nzãa nanu, na bɛfa bɛtuale bakaa bie so, yeɛ bɛfa bɛhɔle ye noa. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Nzãa bɔ enu ka ne hane Yesu noa ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Wayie!” Na osili ye ti ase, yeɛ owuli ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Né sɔ kyẽa ne te Anwoboaboa kyẽa, na né kyẽa bɔ oli berɛ ne te Homeda piri, yeti bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ne fuin nemɔ anga asɛnnua naso Homeda ne, Yudafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele Pilato kyɛ, ɔma bɛbubu bɛ gya nanu, na bɛye fuin nemɔ bɛfi berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Yeti sogyafoɛ nemɔ wale, na bɛ bubuli abrandeɛ bɔ oli moa ne gya nu. Afei kõ bɔ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu bɛbokale ye so ne koso, bɛ bubuli ye gya nanu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Nakoso bɛwale Yesu nwo berɛ ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ wawu dada, yeti bammubu ye gya nu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nakoso, sogyafoɛ nanu kõ fale pea wɔle ye mvenu, na ɛberɛ ala, mogya ne nzue fili ye nu wale. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Na sona bɔ onwuni ɛhe ne, olili ye nwo adanzeɛ, na ye adanzeɛ ne te nahorɛ; na ye de, ɔse kyɛ bɔ ɔka ne te nahorɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔkole bɛkoli ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ wale nu, ná wamaa tworɔnzɛm ne awa nu kyɛ: “Bɛngɔbu ye bowue komapɛ po nu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Na tworɔnzɛm foforɛ koso ka kyɛ: “Bɛkɔnea bɔ bɛfale pea bɛwɔle ye ne.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ye si ne, Yosef bɔ ofi Arimatea ne, Yesu suaniɛ bɔ Yudafoɛ nanwo suronyi ti wangora wanye ye nyunu ne srɛle Pilato kyɛ, ɔpena kyɛ ɔfa Yesu fuin ne. Na Pilato mane ye atee, yeti ɔɔfale fuin ne hɔle. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Na Nikodemo, bɔ mmerɛ bie ɔwale Yesu berɛ kɔngɔen ne wale, na ɔfale kurobo ne pɛprɛ bɔ bafa bafra wale. Ne enu nnunɛ te kɔyɛ kilo 33. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Yeti, bɛfale Yesu fuin ne, na bɛfale ayire né bɛguale nwera nanu, yeɛ bɛfale nwera ne bɛkyekyele ye nwo kyɛbɔ Yudafoɛ sie bɛ fuin ne. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Na nekaa bɔ bɛbɔle Yesu asɛnnua nu ne, né turo bie wɔ berɛ, na ne asieleɛ foforɛ bie wɔ turo nanu bɔ bɛfalle ebiala bɛtolle nu lle. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ne ɔte Yudafoɛ Anwoboaboa Kyẽa nati, bɛfale Yesu bɛɛtole asieleɛ bɔ opingye berɛ nanu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Na dapɛn nanu kyẽa bɔ oli moa ne, Mary Magdalene wale asieleɛ naso ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, né ewienu tettele pa, na onwuni kyɛ baye nyɔboɛ ne bafi asieleɛ ne noa berɛ dada. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Yeti, otuli mirika wale Simon Petro ne suaniɛ bɔ ne Yesu kuro ye dwirɛ paa ne berɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Baye Awurade bafi asieleɛ nanu, na yɛnze nekaa bɔ bafa ye baato ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Yeti, Petro ne suaniɛ kõ ne sili nu kyɛ bɛkɔ asieleɛ naso dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Né bɛ munyɔ namukoraati tu mirika, nakoso suaniɛ kõ ne nwo yɛle nyera trale Petro, yeti odwuli asieleɛ naso dɔ yakyile ye. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Na ɔkotole berɛ tole ye nye neane kumaa nanu, na onwuni kyɛ nwera ne gua berɛ, nakoso wangɔ ye kunu dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Na Simon Petro koso lili ye si wale, na ɔhɔle asieleɛ nanu. Na onwuni kyɛ nwera ne gua berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Ɛtena bɔ bɛfa bɛkyekyele ye ti ne de, né ɔbokka nwera naso, mmom ne babobɔ bagua nekaa bie. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Afei suaniɛ bɔ oli moa hɔle asieleɛ naso ne koso wurale nu, onwuni ye, na ole lili. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Né benya bɛtelle tworɔnzɛm nabo kyɛ, odikyɛ otingye fi ewue nu. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Yeti asuafoɛ nemɔ sa hɔle b'awuro.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Nakoso né Mary tɛ́ gyi asieleɛ ne nyunu berɛ, bɔ ne osu ɔ. Osu ne, ɔkotole berɛ tole ye nye neane asieleɛ nanu dɔ, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />na onwuni abɔfo nyɔ bɔ bɛwura ndadeɛ fufue, kyɛ bɛte nekaa bɔ né Yesu la ne. Né kõ te nekaa bɔ né yeti la ne, yeɛ kõ ne koso te nekaa bɔ né ye gya gua ne. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Maame, nzuati yeɛ esu ne?” Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bafa me wura bahɔ, na menze nekaa bɔ baafa ye bato ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ɔhane ɛhe ne, ɔkakyile ye nwo, na onwuni kyɛ Yesu gyi berɛ, nakoso wannwu kyɛ Yesu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Maame, nzuati yeɛ esu ne? Ɛpena nwa?” Ye de, né y'adwene yɛ ye kyɛ, bɔ ɔnea turo nu berɛ ne ɔ, yeti ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, sɛ wɔ yeɛ afa ye ne a, kyire me nekaa bɔ afa ye ato ne, na ngɔhɔ ngɔɔfa ye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mary!” Na Mary kakyile ye nwo, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye wɔ Hebri nu kyɛ “<char style="tl">Raboni!</char>” (yebo kyire “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yakyi me nu, na nnya ngɔle Baba ne dɔ. Nakoso, kɔ nniema nemɔ dɔ, na ka kyire bɛ kyɛ, ‘Mekɔ me Baba ne ɛmɔ Baba, ne me Nyameɛ ne ɛmɔ Nyameɛ ne berɛ.’” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Yeti, Mary Magdalene wale, na ɔɔbɔle asuafoɛ nemɔ amaneɛ kyɛ: “Manwu Awurade!” Na bɔ Yesu ha hyirele ye ne, ye koso ɔha hyirele bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Na sɔ kyẽa ne, dapɛn ne kyẽa bɔ oli moa ne nnɔsoa ne, né asuafoɛ nemɔ ayia nu, nakoso Yudafoɛ nanwo suronyi ti, né batoto anoa nanu. Na Yesu wale oogyinane bɛ afia berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Asomdwie ha ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ɔhane sɔ ne, ɔfale ye sanu ne ye mvenu ne hyirele bɛ. Na asuafoɛ nemɔ nwuni Awurade ne, bɛ nye gyele paa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu sa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Asomdwie ha ɛmɔ. Kyɛbɔ Baba ne asoma me ne, sɔ ala yeɛ me koso, mesoma ɛmɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ohuli mvrama guale bɛ so, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔle honhom krongron. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Sɛ ɛmɔfa ebie bɔne bɛkyɛ ye a, bafa bahyɛ ye, na ebiala bɔ ɛmɔ amva ye bɔne bangyɛ ye ne, bɛngɔfa bɛngɔhyɛ ye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ Yesu wale ne, Tomas, buru-ne-nyɔ nanu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Atta ne de, né ɔnne berɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Yeti asuafoɛ bɔ baha ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yanwu Awurade!” Nakoso, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ mvale me nye nwuni nnadoaa ne boso bɔ ɔwɔ ye sa nu ne, na mvale me sa ngane ye, na mvale me sa ngane ye mvenu ne a, mengole mengoli.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Na ngyẽa mmɔtwɛ si ne, né asuafoɛ ne asa ayia nu wɔ sua nu, sɔ mmerɛ ne de, ne Tomas boka bɛ so. Né bato anoa nanu, nakoso Yesu wale berɛ, na oogyinane bɛ afia, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Asomdwie ha ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Na ɔha hyirele Tomas kyɛ: “Fa wɔ sa ka wa, na nea me sa nu, na fa wɔ sa ka me mvenu ne, na yakyi aporowaa bɔ esu ne, na dɛ́ di.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Na Tomas ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me Awurade ne me Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛnwuni me nati yeɛ alɛ́ ali ne? Anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛnwuni ye, ná bedɛ bɛdi ne.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu sa yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee wɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ nyunu, na ɛhene de, bandworɔ ye wɔ nwomaa he anu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Mmom bahworɔ sɔ nningyein hemɔ bato berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔkole bɛkoli kyɛ Yesu yeɛ ɔte Kristo ne, Nyameɛ awa ne, na ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali nati, ɛma nate Yesu dumaa naso anya ngoa.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, Yesu sa yele ye nwo ali hyirele asuafoɛ nemɔ wɔ Tiberia po nanwo. Ná sɔa yeɛ ɔyɛle ye ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Né Simon Petro ne Tomas (bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Atta ne), Natanael bɔ ofi Kana bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne, Sebedeo mmaa nemɔ, ne asuafoɛ nyɔ yeɛ né bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Yeɛ Simon Petro ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me kwaahye gyein.” Na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yɛ ne wɔ kɔhɔ.” Yeti bɛfite bɛɛfole ɛlɛen bɛhɔle, nakoso kɔngɔen namu, bannya kõ po.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Na aleɛ baahe ne, né Yesu gyi ɛpo ne noa berɛ, nakoso asuafoɛ nemɔ annwu kyɛ Yesu ane. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me mmaa mɔ, ɛmɔ anya naen ne bie?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Daabi oo!” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔgua nɛt ne wɔ ɛlɛen ne famaa so, na ɛmɔ konya bie.” Yeti bɛyɛle ye sɔ, na egyein bɔ bɛhyele bɛ ne, né bɛngora nɛt ne po twetwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ suaniɛ bɔ Yesu dɔ ye ne ha hyirele Simon Petro kyɛ: “Awurade ane!” Simon Petro tele kyɛ Awurade yeɛ ogyi dɔ ne, ɔfale ye atadeɛ ne wurale (ofikyɛ ne ye nwo la so), na ɔtole ye nwo tole nzue nanu. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nakoso bɛ ngaa ne de, bɛfale ɛlɛen kamba ne bɛwale, na bɛhwene nɛt bɔ naen wɔ nu ne bɛwale, ofikyɛ nekaa bɔ ne bɛwɔ ne, né ɔne aseɛ ne afia nwale, né ɔte kɔyɛ kyɛ 90 mitɛs.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">90 mitɛs </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te kɔyɛ 300 feets (Brɔfo) anaa 100 yards. Greek nu ne, ɔte kubits 200.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Bɛwale ɛpo ne noa ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ bahũa see bɔ naen gua so, na bɛnwuni paanoo koso. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Egyein bɔ ɛmɔ ahye ye kesaalae ne, ɛmɔfa bie bɛbra.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Yeti Simon Petro dwɔsole, na ɔɔhwene nɛt ne wale, né egyein mbiri-mbiri 153 ayi ye dɛen, nakoso nɛt ne andete. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔbra bɛɛdidi.” Nakoso bɛ nu biala annya akukuduro ammisa ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa?” Ofikyɛ né bɛse kyɛ Awurade ane. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu fale paanoo ne mane bɛ, na sɔ ala yeɛ ɔyɛle egyein ne ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yesu tingye fili ewue nu ne, né ɛhe te ye pɛn nza so bɔ waye ye nwo ali wahyire asuafoɛ nemɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bɛdidi bɛyiele ne, Yesu bisale Petro kyɛ: “Simon, Yohane awa, ɛdɔ me tra ɛhemɔ?” Petro hane kyɛ: “Yoo, Awurade, ɛse kyɛ medɔ wɔ.” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ma me mmoan ne aleɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu sa bisale ye bieku kyɛ: “Simon, Yohane awa, ɛdɔ me?” Petro hane kyɛ: “Yoo, Awurade, ɛse kyɛ mekuro wɔ dwirɛ.” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea me mmoan naso.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Osa bisale ye pɛn nza so kyɛ: “Simon, Yohane awa, ɛkuro me dwirɛ?” Na Petro wora bɔle kyɛ wabisa ye pɛn nza kyɛ, “Aso ekuro me dwirɛ?” Yeti ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, ɛse nikye biala, ɛse kyɛ mekuro wɔ dwirɛ.” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ma me mmoan ne aleɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Nahorɛ paa bɔ meka mekyire wɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛte abrandeɛ ne, wɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ ne ewura wɔ atadeɛ nate kɔ nekaa biala bɔ ekuro ɔ, nakoso sɛ ɛyɛ aworowaa a, ɛkɔ tengyɛ wɔ sa, ná ebie awura wɔ atadeɛ, ná wafa wɔ wahɔ nekaa bɔ okuro ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Ɔhane ɛhe fa hyirele ewue horɛ bɔ ne Petro kowu kɔhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam ne. Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ; “Di me si.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petro pɛle ye nye, na onwuni suaniɛ bɔ Yesu kuro ye dwirɛ ne kyɛ oli bɛ si. Sɔ Suaniɛ ne yeɛ nnɔsoa bɔ bɛdidi, né watena wakisa Yesu, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nwa yeɛ ɔbaaye wɔ ma ne?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ Petro nye bɔle ye so ne, obisale Yesu kyɛ: “Awurade, nná ɛhe koso ɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ mepena kyɛ ɔtena berɛ kodwu kyɛ ngɔwa a, ɔfa wɔ nwo nzu? Wɔ de, kɔ so di me si.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Yeti, né bɛkeka ye wɔ aliemaa nemɔ nu kyɛ, sɔ suaniɛ he ngowu. Nakoso Yesu anga angyire ye kyɛ ongowu, mmom bɔ ɔhane yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Sɛ mepena kyɛ ɔtena berɛ kodwu kyɛ ngɔwa a, ɔfa wɔ nwo nzu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Sɔ suaniɛ ne yeɛ odi ɛhemɔ nwo adanzeɛ ne, na ye yeɛ ɔhworɔle ɛhemɔ ne, na yɛse kyɛ ye adanzeɛ ne te nahorɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, Yesu yɛle nningyein pee; sɛ bɛhane kyɛ bɛtworɔ ye mukoraati a, nwomaa bɔ ahaa bɛkɔhworɔ ye wɔ nu ne, menne menni kyɛ ɔkɔhɔ wiase po.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>